***REMOVED***"summary": "For international students, this online session will help you get started in navigating through University life! HiQ Peer Concierges will guide your enrolment and introduce you to the HiQ and other digital platforms that will help you self-service and curate your University experience.",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p><span style=\"background-color: initial\">Coming to university can feel as though there are so many possible futures to choose from. With 53,000&nbsp;<\/span>students, and&nbsp;over 100 courses and a focus on real-world experience, you might feel as though you are just one little fish in the sea.<\/p><p>The goal of this session is to help you complete your enrolment and to learn how to&nbsp;navigate the many choices that will be available to you throughout University. The best way to do that is to introduce you to our HiQ and other digital platforms, which will help you to better&nbsp;self-service and curate your university experience in a way that reflects your changing interests over time.&nbsp;We\u2019ll be taking you through all of the behind-the-scenes systems that are the launch pad for everything QUT, helping you be on the front foot for important milestones like enrolment.<\/p><p>This session will also give you exposure to some of the different possibilities available to you at QUT and help you understand how can structure your Uni experience to try out different opportunities.<\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\"><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\"><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\"><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\"><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\"><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">admincode:international_hiq_online_new_to_qut_12026<\/span><\/p>",
