***REMOVED***"summary": "Got a question related to your future study, career choice, industry experience, job search, application or internship ? ",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>If you are studying Business and\/or Law and would like to chat with a&nbsp;Career Educator or have a specific question,&nbsp;drop-in to see Nardine and Bec.<\/p><p><strong>Day and Time: <\/strong>Each Wednesday between 9am and 12pm<\/p><p><strong>Location: <\/strong>Level 4 Z Block (Z407 Student Support office) between 9am and 12pm.<\/p><p><strong>We can help you with....<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Course decisions - choosing a major or minor, considering another course or not sure if your course is for you<\/li><li>Career options - what can you do with your degree<\/li><li>Getting part time or causal work whilst you study<\/li><li>Getting industry experience<\/li><li>Internships, vacationer programs, clerkships<\/li><li>Job search<\/li><li>Job applications<\/li><li>LinkedIn and professional branding<\/li><li>Building confidence in networking<\/li><li>AND anything else you can think of!<\/li><\/ul><p>Can't make it on campus?&nbsp;Please email Nardine and Bec on <strong>success.buslaw@qut.edu.au<\/strong> using&nbsp;'Careers Office' in the email subject header.<\/p><p>We look forward to chatting with you<\/p><p>buslaw<\/p><p>ADVSSGCAR<\/p>",
