***REMOVED***"summary": "A group interview for students who wish to join the QUT Connect student volunteer program.",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>QUT Connect is an on-campus and university-run volunteering program which provides current students the opportunity to help new students settle into university life and actively contribute to building a vibrant campus community. Volunteers assist with a range of events throughout each year, whilst building their networks and transferable skills along the way. Plus, volunteers have the opportunity to make friends and attend social events as part of the program.<\/p><p>Each applicant must complete a 2hr interview to assess their areas of strength and suitability for the position. All you need to bring is your enthusiasm!<\/p><p>Each successful interviewee will have to complete TWO mandatory Induction Workshops prior to being able to volunteer as part of the program. In addition, one day of Pre-Welcome Week Training is required for those wishing to volunteer during Welcome Week. More details about how you can be involved will be communicated to you after the interview.<\/p><p><strong>Please note: you do not need to study at a particular campus to attend an interview there.<\/strong> We offer interviews at both campuses for convenience only - you can attend whichever campus suits your schedule, regardless if you study there or not.<\/p><p><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">Admin Tag: \"qutconnect_interview\"<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>",
