***REMOVED***"summary": "A welcome session for those joining the QUT Connect Program after a successful interview",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>QUT Connect is an on-campus and university run volunteering program which provides current students the opportunity to help new students settle into university life and actively contribute to building a vibrant campus community.<\/p><p>The Welcome to Connect session will provide successful interviewees with a portion of their foundational training. You will also have the opportunity to meet fellow volunteers who have also recently joined the QUT Connect Program.<\/p><p>Topics in this workshop include:<\/p><ul> <li>What is QUT Connect and how do we volunteer<\/li><li>Risk management<\/li><li>Excelling in your role (via emotional intelligence &amp; listening skills)<\/li><\/ul><p>This workshop is one of two mandatory sessions for those wanting to become a QUT Connector.<\/p><p><strong>Students signing up for this workshop should be aware that our mandatory training for those wishing to volunteer during Welcome Week in Semester 1 will be held on Friday 30&nbsp;Jan (all day). Please save this date if you are wishing to volunteer for the upcoming Welcome Week.<\/strong><\/p>",
