***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Want to boost your experience and develop skills in the real world&nbsp;while at uni? This workshop covers:<\/p><ul><li>\ud83d\udcbc <strong>Job options<\/strong> that fit around your studies<\/li><li>\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Smart job search strategies<\/strong> to find the right roles<\/li><li>\ud83d\udcdd <strong>Tips for standout applications<\/strong><\/li><\/ul><p>Join us to discover how to gain real-world experience while juggling uni life!<\/p><p>Part of our<em>&nbsp;Faculty of Health Career<\/em> series of workshops<\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">ADVSSGCAR<\/span><\/p>",
