***REMOVED***"summary": "Learn how to better support HDR students wanting an academic career. Please enter from here: https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/students\/Events\/Online\/6862240",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Learn how to better support HDR students wanting an academic career. In this workshop, we will be discussing strategies to assist HDRs with their career planning for jobs in academia, through case studies, the latest HDR careers research, and your own supervisory experiences.<\/p><p><strong>What you'll learn:<\/strong><\/p><ul> <li>Help HDRs identify available career support<\/li><li>Develop coaching strategies to encourage your HDRs to better plan for careers within academia<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Key benefits:<\/strong><\/p><ul> <li>Find out how the HDR Career Education program can assist you in your supervisory practice<\/li><li>Attending this event satisfies your supervisor professional development requirements for accreditation for two years<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>What previous participants have said:<\/strong><\/p><p><em>Many successful points: excellent curation of current resources; Karen is very knowledgeable and respectful of variety of views; the session is broken into appropriate amount of workshop\/interactive activities. In particular, Karen has performed an excellent service in bringing together a range of existing resources and policies to show how this can be harnessed for the particular issue at hand, that is, how to be more proactive in guiding HDR students\u2019 post PhD careers.<\/em><\/p><p>Offering: GRE+D SUP RSCS036<\/p>",
