***REMOVED***"summary": "A support session for BSB108 students to help you with assignment 2 - Insight report",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Need help with your second BSB108 assignment? There will be 2 online support sessions facilitated by Language and Learning Educators from the Faculty of Business &amp; Law Student Success team as well as FBL Student Learning Advisors who have previously completed BSB108. <\/p><p>The sessions will cover important skills for assignment writing such as:<\/p><ul> <li>Assignment planning process<\/li><li>Finding and organising research<\/li><li>Organising evidence based on the assignment outline<\/li><li>Writing clearly and appropriately<\/li><\/ul><p>The sessions will respond to student needs, so come along ready to ask questions and we will adjust the content of the session to suit the students who attend.<\/p>",
