***REMOVED***"summary": "Prepare for the numeracy component of the LANTITE assessment with tips and strategies for tackling the test. Day 1: Fractions, decimals, percentages & mathematical mindsets",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px\">Prepare for LANTITE numeracy!<\/span><\/strong><\/p><p>\n\tFeel more confident about the test, learn powerful problem-solving strategies and upgrade your maths skills over 3 days in a fun, supportive and empowering environment.<\/p><ul>\n\t\n<li>3 x 2hr on-campus workshops,***REMOVED***  (or 3 x 1.5 hr online workshops)<\/li>\t\n<li>Ongoing support<\/li><\/ul><p>\n\t<img src=\"https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/files\/shared\/cogEe_7IYDjQk5FWNFKbB1OrXM0aePwctOOOo75JIDI1\/GettyImages-1369934119%20Maths%20class%20teacher%20students.jpg\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; margin: auto; width: 480px\"><\/p><p>\n\tPOV: You're going to be an amazing teacher and have a positive impact on the lives of your students.  But, to make that happen, you need to <strong>make friends with maths<\/strong>! If you've forgotten all the formulas, if you never learned your times tables, if numbers scare you, or if you'd just like to <strong>nail LANTITE numeracy before semester starts<\/strong>, then join us 3 days of LANTITE Bootcamp!<\/p><p>\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px\">Workshop 1: fractions, decimals &amp; percentages<\/span><\/strong><\/p><ul>\n\t\n<li>We discuss how to approach***REMOVED***  maths, and build an empowering mathematical mindset as an educator.<\/li>\t\n<li>We learn about the test***REMOVED***  structure, content and what to expect<\/li>\t\n<li>We tackle the toughest topic,***REMOVED***  and make friends with fractions, decimals, percentages!<\/li><\/ul><p>\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px\">Workshop 2: number and algebra<\/span><\/strong><\/p><ul>\n\t\n<li>We apply the most powerful***REMOVED***  problem-solving strategies to tackle worded problems.<\/li>\t\n<li>We unpack the meaning of all***REMOVED***  the operations + - * \/.<\/li>\t\n<li>We practice with rates &amp;***REMOVED***  ratios algebra.<\/li><\/ul><p>\n\t<strong><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px\">Workshop 3: measurement &amp; geometry<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p><ul>\n\t\n<li>We cover***REMOVED***  measurement:length, area and volume, time, and geometry: maps and direction<\/li>\t\n<li>We start on statistics &amp;***REMOVED***  probability: mean, median mode, reading graphs and tables.<\/li>\t\n<li>Test strategies: how to***REMOVED***  manage your time, and your mental and emotional resources.<\/li><\/ul><p>\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px\">Ongoing support to prepare for LANTITE<\/span><\/strong><\/p><ul>\n\t\n<li>Online learning materials: <a href=\"https:\/\/canvas.qut.edu.au\/courses\/1696\/pages\/step-2-numeracy-lantite-bootcamp?module_item_id=985463\"><span style=\"color: rgba(79, 129, 189, 1)\">LANTITE Bootcamp online***REMOVED***  modules<\/span><\/a><\/li>\t\n<li>2 x Practice tests: <a href=\"https:\/\/canvas.qut.edu.au\/courses\/1696\/pages\/step-3-numeracy-practice-test?module_item_id=985483\">Numeracy practice tests<\/a><\/li>\t\n<li>One-on-one coaching session<\/li>\t\n<li>We setup a study group:***REMOVED***  because maths is best learned together !<\/li><\/ul><p>\n\t<strong>Attending on-campus? <\/strong> The space will be booked for you to stick around with your peers, have some lunch and continue studying.<\/p><p>\n\t<strong>Attending online? <\/strong>We like to make these online sessions as interactive as possible, so please bring along questions as well as smiling faces and encouraging words (switching on your webcam and mic is appreciated to bring the sessions to life!). Online via Zoom - a link will be provided upon registration for this workshop.<\/p><p>\n\t<strong>Can't make it?&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/strong>You can visit the <a href=\"https:\/\/canvas.qut.edu.au\/courses\/1696\">Preparing for LANTITE Canvas site<\/a> to access the online materials at any time.  You can also email any questions to <a href=\"mailto:success.ciesj@qut.edu.au\">success.ciesj@qut.edu.au<\/a>.<\/p><p>\n\tADVSSG0043a<\/p>",
