***REMOVED***"summary": "Workshop 1: Don't have graduate career ideas yet? OR do have ideas and not sure how to make it happen? ",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>A business degree is broad and&nbsp;can provide many graduate career pathways and knowing which one fits you is a challenge.&nbsp;This workshop is for Bachelor of Business Students who are looking for guidance on crafting their career in business, developing employability and are motivated to be&nbsp;'career ready' upon graduation.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p><p>In this workshop, you will learn;<\/p><ul> <li>Strategies to identify&nbsp;career options that fit you considering&nbsp;your business degree and&nbsp;major&nbsp;<\/li><li>The steps to work towards your ideal graduate opportunity&nbsp;<\/li><li>How to get help to implement actions&nbsp;and stay on track&nbsp;<\/li><\/ul><p>If you have a question about this workshop please email&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:success.buslaw@qut.edu.au\">success.buslaw@qut.edu.au<\/a><\/p><p>buslaw<\/p><p>ADVSSGCAR<\/p>",
