***REMOVED***"summary": "Workshop 2: Learn how to apply for and express interest in gaining relevant industry experience whilst you study.",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>A business degree is broad and&nbsp;can provide many pathways for industry experience and knowing which one fits you can be a challenge.&nbsp;This workshop is for Bachelor of Business Students who are keen to learn how they can gain industry experience during their degree.&nbsp;<\/p><p>In this workshop, you will;<\/p><ul> <li>Identify what industry experience would be valuable for you<\/li><li>Learn steps&nbsp;to find and&nbsp;apply for internships\/WIL\/vacationer programs<\/li><li>Strategies for sourcing your own internship \/WIL\/industry experience<\/li><li>How to get support at QUT<\/li><\/ul><p>If you have a question about this workshop please email&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:success.buslaw@qut.edu.au\">success.buslaw@qut.edu.au<\/a><\/p><p>buslaw<\/p><p>ADVSSGCAR<\/p>",
