***REMOVED***"details": "<p>QUT Connect Welcome Week&nbsp;Training is your chance to meet more like-minded people and become fully prepared for your role as a Connector in Welcome Week Semester 1, 2026, as well as for additional roles throughout the year.<\/p><p><strong>This training is compulsory for anyone new to Connect in 2026<\/strong>&nbsp;(i.e. you have never completed this training before, but <strong>HAVE<\/strong> completed a Welcome to Connect session and a Diversity, Inclusion and Culture&nbsp;session).&nbsp;<\/p><p>This training will allow students to upskill on how to facilitate an effective QUT101 session, become more aware of the roles available to them during Welcome Week and beyond, and develop their knowledge base for use when working with students in sessions and the wider university environment.<\/p><p><strong>Registration will be open from 8:45am. Please bring a water bottle. Catering will be provided throughout the day. Dress code is casual clothing suitable for summer.<\/strong><\/p><p>If you have any dietary requirements, please complete this form by January 26, 2026:&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/form.aspx?id=6896350\">https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/form.aspx?id=6896350<\/a><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">. If you <\/span><b style=\"background-color: initial\">do not <\/b><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">have any dietary requirements, you do not need to complete this form.<\/span><\/p><p>See you there!<\/p><p><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">Admin Tag: \"Connect_Training\"<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>",
