***REMOVED***"summary": "QUT Connect Pre-Orientation Training - Highly-recommended refresher for Returning Connectors",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>QUT Connect Welcome Week&nbsp;Training is your chance to meet our commencing Connect volunteers, contribute your experience to their learning, as well as see our completely revamped QUT101 slidedeck we'll be using for this coming Orientation.<\/p><p><strong>This training is strongly recommended for anyone returning to Connect in 2026<\/strong>&nbsp;(i.e. you've completed this training before) as it will include activities centring around our revamped QUT101 slide deck. If you cannot attend, we strongly encourage you to spend some extra time reviewing the slides in your own time.<\/p><p><strong>Registration will be open from 8:45am. Please bring a water bottle. Lunch will be provided following the QUT101 training component after which you are welcome to stay\/depart. Dress code is casual clothing suitable for summer.<\/strong><\/p><p>If you have any dietary requirements, please complete this form by January 26, 2026:&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/form.aspx?id=6896350\">https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/form.aspx?id=6896350<\/a><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">. If you <\/span><b style=\"background-color: initial\">do not <\/b><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">have any dietary requirements, you do not need to complete this form.<\/span><\/p><p>See you there!<\/p><p><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">Admin Tag: \"Connect_Training\"<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>",
