***REMOVED***"summary": "Welcome to QUT! This session will provide you with key insights into life at QUT, the support services available to you and how to access them and upcoming events. You'll also have the opportunity to ask any questions you may have.",
***REMOVED***"details": "<h3>Overview<\/h3><p>Welcome to QUT!&nbsp;This session will provide you with key&nbsp;insights into life at QUT, the support services available to you and how to access them&nbsp;and upcoming events.&nbsp;You'll also have the opportunity to ask any questions you may have.<\/p><h4><\/h4><h3>What will you gain from this session?<\/h3><ul>\n\t\n<li>Key insights and advice&nbsp;from current students&nbsp;<\/li>\t\n<li>Support services available to you and how to access them - including academic and professional support, financial support, disability support&nbsp;and counselling<\/li><li>Answers to any of your questions<\/li>\t\n<li>Practical advice about finding accommodation, employment and getting around Brisbane<\/li>\t\n<li>Upcoming events at QUT&nbsp;<\/li>\t\n<li>Opportunities to connect with&nbsp;other students<\/li><\/ul><h3>Who should attend?<\/h3><p>This session is tailored to students from remote and regional areas however this session&nbsp;would be beneficial to any student commencing at QUT.&nbsp;<\/p><h3>Social Event<\/h3><p>Friday 10th February, 12pm - 2pm: grab a free coffee and chat with other commencing students and student ambassadors.&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/students\/events\/detail\/6753939\">Register Here<\/a><\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\"><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">\"admin_code:early_engagement\"<\/span><\/p>",
