***REMOVED***"details": "<p>You\u2019ve been working on your idea through <strong>Side Hustle, Venture Catalyst&nbsp;or&nbsp;Growth Lab<\/strong>, but since the program has ended, you\u2019ve lost your mojo and don\u2019t know what to do next? <\/p><p>Sound familiar?&nbsp;&nbsp;We have your back!&nbsp; QUT Entrepreneurship has&nbsp;introduced a new Group Mentoring Session!<\/p><p>These will be held&nbsp;once a month for two hours in The foundry, before each Open Pitch Night.<\/p><p>We will cover a topic each month&nbsp;and you can work on that topic in the session. Or you can come along and work on whatever it is you are currently working on with your idea, and we\u2019ll be there to offer support, advice, opinions, and help you with your \u2018next steps\u2019.<\/p><p>As the sessions fall on the same day as Open Pitch Night, you may want to stay and attend that, either to keep practising your pitching (I challenge you to do it!), or as a spectator. <a href=\"https:\/\/events.humanitix.com\/qut-entrepreneurship-open-pitch-night-2026\" target=\"_blank\">Here\u2019s the Open Pitch Night link.<\/a><\/p><p><strong>February Group Mentoring Session: Wednesday, 4 February 2026, from 3 to 5pm.<\/strong><\/p>",
