***REMOVED***"summary": " Are you planning an internship, seeking volunteer work, or looking for a work placement? Or perhaps you\u2019re considering the undergraduate unit SCB300 as part of your study plan in semester 1 2026? ",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Are you planning an internship, seeking volunteer work, or looking for a work placement? Or perhaps you\u2019re considering the undergraduate unit SCB300 as part of your study plan in 2026? This workshop is designed specifically for Faculty of Science students (including those in&nbsp;Science, Maths, IT, Games, and&nbsp;Data Science, both&nbsp;undergraduate and post-graduate). Join us to explore the importance of Work Integrated Learning (WIL) and how you might be able to secure a WIL opportunity.<\/p><p>Workshop topics will include:<\/p><ul> <li><strong>Understanding WIL:<\/strong>&nbsp;Explore why real world learning (WIL) is crucial for your career development.<\/li><li><strong>Strategic Planning:<\/strong> Get tips and resources to create an effective strategy for finding placements.<\/li><li><strong>Career Support:<\/strong> Receive resources to&nbsp;refine your marketing collateral and enhance your professional identity.<\/li><\/ul><p>ADVSSGCAR<\/p><p>FoSCareers1<\/p><p>#FoSWIL<\/p>",
