***REMOVED***"summary": "Engage with other researchers to focus on writing clear and specific research questions. Please join from here: https:\/\/canvas.qut.edu.au\/courses\/19439\/pages\/focus-week, (only works once you have self-enrolled in the module)",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Another way to complete the Write your Research proposal module is to enrol in the Write your Research Questions Focus Week. With like-minded researchers and an expert staff member, you\u2019ll work through the module content as a group, exploring research questions in discussion forums. You\u2019re welcome to attend if you haven\u2019t yet completed the module, but will get the most out of Focus Week if you\u2019re already familiar with the content. The experience is week-long, but your commitment may be less than 30 minutes per day, at a time that suits you.<\/p><p><strong>What you'll learn:<\/strong><\/p><ul> <li>Gain a deeper understanding of the strategies provided in the Write your Research Proposal module.<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Key benefits:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Engage with your peers in a facilitated online discussion<\/li><li>Have your questions answered and your answers questioned!<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>What previous participants have said:<\/strong><\/p><p><em>The feedback sessions that allowed me to know what path I was on in terms of the development of my research topic and questions.<\/em><\/p><p>Offering: GRE+D AC RSCH225<\/p>",
