***REMOVED***"summary": "Top tips for job search strategies and writing winning applications ",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>If you\u2019re in the penultimate or final year of your Bachelor of Nursing degree, now is the time to start exploring graduate RN roles and preparing strong applications, as some programs require your r\u00e9sum\u00e9 and written responses up to six months before graduation.<\/p><p> This session will cover<\/p><ul> <li>An overview of the RN career pathways<\/li><li>Key recruitment dates and timelines<\/li><li>What graduate RN recruiters look for<\/li><li>Tips to tailor and target your applications. <\/li><\/ul><p><em>Bring your questions and resumes along and be ready to join in this interactive session.<\/em><\/p><p>Part of our<em style=\"background-color: initial\"> Launch Your RN Career<\/em> series of workshops<\/p><p>ADVSSGCAR<\/p><p>DECIDE and PLAN your career<\/p>",
