***REMOVED***"summary": "Find out about a range of support available for students with a disability, injury, chronic illness,  mental health condition or other health condition.",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>QUT has a range of supports and services for students with a disability, injury, chronic illness, mental health condition or other health condition. Join us at the Disability and Accessibility Info Session and Tour to find out what support you can receive to help you as your start your university studies. <\/p><p><strong>The session will include:<\/strong><\/p><p>Information on QUT Disability and Accessibility Services, including adjustments available to assist with your study.<\/p><p>A presentation from the QUT Guild Disability Collective.<\/p><p>Presentations from students who have accessed QUT support.<\/p><p>An accessible campus tour of Gardens Point&nbsp;campus.<\/p><p>Light refreshments.<\/p><p>---<\/p><p>This information session will be held in a room with wheelchair access, dimmed lighting and hearing assistance. Please advise us if you require&nbsp;an AUSLAN Interpreter for the information session. The session will also be livestreamed for those who can't make it onto campus. More information on accessibility, parking and the campus tour will be sent in early February.<\/p><p>To ensure we provide an accessible and enjoyable event, please complete this Accessibility and Dietary Requirements Form: <a href=\"https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/form.aspx?id=6508901\">https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/form.aspx?id=6508901<\/a><\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/Form.aspx?id=5618632\"><\/a><\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">\"admin_code_disability_accessibility_25.2\"<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\"><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">\"admin_code:early_engagement\"<\/span><\/p>",
