***REMOVED***"summary": "Join us for a tour of Brisbane city.",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Want to get acquainted with the Brisbane area? Our city tour is available for current students to familiarise yourself with the amazing sights and fun things to do in the CBD.<\/p><p>Please bring your walking shoes, water bottle, hand sanitiser and sun protection.&nbsp;Please note this tour is a walking tour.<\/p><p>You must register for this session. Tour guides will monitor numbers as registrations are limited based on ideal group size. <\/p><p>Tours will last for 60-90 minutes and will depart from Main Drive outside&nbsp;A Block.<\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">Tour2024.1<\/span><\/p>",
