***REMOVED***"details": "<p>This online workshop for HDR students and staff will introduce the basics of research data management at QUT, as well as demonstrate a number of tools and resources to assist you to manage your information and data. <\/p><p>What you will learn:<\/p><ul><li>General, legal, ethical and policy responsibilities<\/li><li>Where and how to get research data management support at QUT<\/li><li>How to use the&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/data-mgmt-plan.qut.edu.au\/\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(238, 236, 225, 1)\">Data Management Planner<\/span><\/a><\/li><li>Recommended storage and sharing options<\/li><li>Research data organisation<\/li><li>Publishing, licensing, copyright, and DOIs for data<\/li><li>Understanding preservation responsibilities<\/li><li>Data publishing and reuse<\/li><li>Using QUT\u2019s&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/researchdatafinder.qut.edu.au\/\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(238, 236, 225, 1)\">Research Data Finder<\/span><\/a> (data repository)<\/li><\/ul><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(238, 236, 225, 1)\"><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(238, 236, 225, 1)\"><\/span><\/p><p style=\"text-align: right\"><\/p><p style=\"text-align: right\"><\/p><p style=\"text-align: right\">LIBOSC026<\/p>",
