***REMOVED***"summary": "The module Developing a Personal Evaluation Strategy is an opportunity for professional development for those who teach or support learning. This facilitated workshop complements the online self-directed learning available on Canvas.",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>This workshop forms part of the Real Time Learning module <strong>Developing a Personal Evaluation Strategy<\/strong>. The workshop complements the online self-directed component available <u><a href=\"http:\/\/bit.ly\/RTL6_Register\" target=\"_blank\">via Canvas<\/a><\/u>.<\/p><p>On completion of the module you will be able to:<\/p><ul> <li>Outline evidence informed methods for the evaluation of learning and teaching.<\/li><li>Construct a personal plan for the evaluation of learning and teaching activities.<\/li><\/ul><p>A certificate of completion will be issued once you have completed the online component and attended the facilitated workshop associated with this module.<\/p><p>Professional Development in Learning and Teaching (PDLT) is available to all academic, sessional and professional staff at QUT who teach or support learning. The broad suite of modules are designed to enable you to access evidence-based development in line with your teaching needs and professional development.<\/p><p>This module is part of the Real Time Learning set, designed for more experienced staff, these modules go beyond the foundations to support ongoing recognition and the further development of good practice.<\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\"><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px\">RTL10<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>",
