***REMOVED***"summary": "Are you a new staff member to QUT, recently changed roles, or want a refresher on our purchasing and payment processes? Finance Support\u2019s new online training is designed to ensure all QUT staff are supported to follow the latest finance procedures.",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p><strong>What will you learn?<\/strong><\/p><p>The session will cover essential topics, including:<\/p><ul><li>understanding and***REMOVED***  adhering to QUT\u2019s procurement policy and purchasing thresholds<\/li><li>differentiating***REMOVED***  between Click to Buy eMarketplace suppliers and others<\/li><li>correctly purchasing chemicals and hazardous goods<\/li><li>ensuring invoices***REMOVED***  are paid promptly<\/li><li>the importance of receipting<\/li><li>completing the purchase order process.<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Why attend?<\/strong><\/p><p>The session will include a dedicated time for questions and seek advice on specific challenges you might be facing. If we can\u2019t provide an answer immediately, we\u2019ll make sure to connect you with the appropriate team that can assist.<\/p><p>Each session offers the same content, so attending one will cover everything you need. We are offering these sessions monthly at various times to accommodate everyone's schedule. This initiative is part of our ongoing commitment to improving financial literacy across the university. We\u2019re here to ensure you have the knowledge and support you need to navigate QUT\u2019s finance processes effectively.<\/p><p>Don\u2019t miss out on these valuable sessions! <\/p>",
