***REMOVED***"summary": "Find out about a range of support available for students with a disability, injury, chronic illness,  mental health condition or other health condition.",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>QUT has a range of supports and services for students with a disability, injury, chronic illness, mental health condition or other health condition. Join us at the Disability and Accessibility Info Session and Tour to find out what support you can receive to help you as your start your university studies. <\/p><p><strong>The session will include:<\/strong><\/p><p>Information on QUT Disability and Accessibility Services, including adjustments available to assist with your study.<\/p><p>A presentation from the QUT Guild Disability Collective.<\/p><p>Presentations from students who have accessed QUT support.<\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">\"admin_code_disability_accessibility_25.2\"<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\"><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">\"admin_code:early_engagement\"<\/span><\/p>",
