***REMOVED***"summary": "An interactive session for HDR students and staff to help you plan to manage your data using QUT\u2019s Data Management Planner. ",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>This presentation and Q&amp;A session for HDR students and staff will introduce QUT's Data Management Planner, with half the time dedicated for your questions and troubleshooting.<\/p><p>What you will learn:<\/p><ul><li>Why research data management matters<\/li><li>Who needs a data management plan<\/li><li>How to access the Data Management Planner<\/li><li>How to create and export a data management plan<\/li><li>Version control to maintain data provenance<\/li><li>HDR supervisor features available<\/li><\/ul><p>Please bring along any concerns, questions, or draft plans.<\/p><p style=\"text-align: right\"><\/p><p style=\"text-align: right\">LIBOSC027<\/p>",
