***REMOVED***"summary": "KickSTART your life at university from Wednesday 11 February to Thursday 12 February, 2026. Get to know other commencing QUT students and learn about the various services, programs and resources available to help you succeed at university!",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Starting uni can feel like a big leap \u2014 but you don\u2019t have to do it alone. <strong style=\"font-family: Helvetica; background-color: initial; color: rgba(34, 34, 34, 1)\">KickSTART<\/strong> is a two-day program designed to help you feel confident, connected, and ready to thrive at QUT.<\/p><p><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica\">Join us for a relaxed, supportive experience where you\u2019ll:<\/span><\/p><ul><li><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica\">Get insider tips from successful students<\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica\">Discover the support services and resources available to you<\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica\">Build your uni skills and confidence<\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica\">Connect with other new students and start building your QUT community<\/span><\/li><\/ul><h4><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica\"><br><\/span><\/h4><h4><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica\">\ud83d\udcc5 Program Dates<\/span><\/h4><p><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica\"><strong>Wednesday 11 February 2026<\/strong><br> \ud83d\udccd <em>Z411,<\/em>&nbsp;<em>Gardens Point Campus<\/em><br> \ud83d\udd63 8:30am \u2013 3:30pm<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica\"><strong>Thursday 12 February 2026<\/strong><br> \ud83d\udccd <em>F509<\/em>,&nbsp;<em>Kelvin Grove Campus<\/em><br> \ud83d\udd64 9:30am \u2013 2:30pm<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica\">By registering, you\u2019re committing to attend both days \u2014 and trust us, you\u2019ll want to!<\/span><\/p><p>Across the two days, you\u2019ll:<\/p><ul><li><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica\">Attend engaging lectures on <strong>Growth Mindset<\/strong>, <strong>Career Skills<\/strong>, and <strong>Learning Skills<\/strong>&nbsp;to get a real taste of uni life<\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica\">Dive deeper in small-group sessions led by current students (like a sneak peek into tutorials!)<\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica\">Ask your burning questions at student Q&amp;A panels<\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica\">Explore both campuses with guided tours<\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica\">Meet other new students and start building your uni network<\/span><\/li><\/ul><h4><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica\"><br><\/span><\/h4><h4><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica\">\ud83d\udc4b Who Should Attend?<\/span><\/h4><p><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica\">KickSTART is open to all new QUT students, but especially valuable if you:<\/span><\/p><ul><li><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica\">Are the first in your family to attend university<\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica\">Have relocated from a regional or remote area<\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica\">Come from a low socio-economic background<\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica\">Are a non-school leaver (21+)<\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica\">Come from a culturally and linguistically diverse background<\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica\">Are a woman entering a STEM field<\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica\">Are starting at QUT in Semester 1, 2026 and want a head start<\/span><\/li><\/ul><p><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica\"><\/span><\/p><h4><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica\"><br><\/span><\/h4><h4><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica\">\u2705 How to Register<\/span><\/h4><p><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica\">Click 'Book' above and complete the short registration form to secure your place. You will be sent more information about the schedule and connecting with other participants in the weeks leading up to KickSTART.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica\">Spots are limited and this program fills fast, so register early! If the program reaches capacity, you\u2019ll be added to a waitlist and notified if a spot opens up.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica\">For more information, contact the KickSTART team at&nbsp;<\/span><a><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica\">kickstart@qut.edu.au&nbsp;<\/span><\/a><\/p><p><a><\/a><\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">\"admin_code:early_engagement\"<\/span><\/p><p><strong><\/strong><\/p>",
