***REMOVED***"summary": "Discover how your beliefs about intelligence can shape your learning journey, and learn to embrace challenges as opportunities for growth.",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Unlock your potential with our workshop on Growth Mindset and Study Strategies! Discover how your beliefs about intelligence can shape your learning journey, and learn to embrace challenges as opportunities for growth. We\u2019ll explore the concept of neuroplasticity, showing you that your brain can adapt and improve with effort. Additionally, you\u2019ll learn about valuable resources available to support your academic success and career preparation. Don\u2019t miss this chance to develop a positive mindset and enhance your study skills for a brighter future!<\/p><p>ADVSSG0015i<\/p><p style=\"margin-left: 1120px\"><\/p><p style=\"margin-left: 1120px\"><\/p>",
