***REMOVED***"summary": "The module Developing Effective Educational Videos is an opportunity for professional development for those who teach or support learning. This interactive facilitated workshop complements the online self-directed learning available on Canvas.",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>\n\tThis workshop forms part of the Real Time Learning module <strong>Developing Effective Educational Videos<\/strong>. The workshop complements the online self-directed component available <u><a href=\"https:\/\/bit.ly\/RTL12_Register\" target=\"_blank\">via Canvas<\/a><\/u>.<\/p><p>\n\tOn completion of the module you will be able to:<\/p><ul>\n\t\n<li>Identify factors that impact student learning in educational videos<\/li>\t\n<li>Design and produce DIY educational videos that maximise student learning in your context<\/li><\/ul><p>\n\tA certificate of completion will be issued once you have completed the online component and&nbsp;participated in the interactive&nbsp;facilitated workshop associated with this module.<\/p><p>\n\tProfessional Development in Learning and Teaching (PDLT) is available to all academic, sessional and professional staff at QUT who teach or support learning. The broad suite of modules are designed to enable you to access evidence-based development in line with your teaching needs and professional development.<\/p><p>\n\tThis module is part of the Real Time Learning set, designed for more experienced staff, these modules go beyond the foundations to support ongoing recognition and the further development of good practice.<\/p><p>\n\t<strong><span style=\"color: rgba(192, 80, 77, 1)\">Important:&nbsp;<\/span><\/strong><\/p><p>1. We are aim to run this session in a computer room. However, we ask that if you have a laptop computer (preferred) or other portable device such as an iPad that you bring this to the session to use. In this case, we recommend downloading relevant software beforehand  in preparation (see below)<\/p><p>2. Use of Microsoft PowerPoint and Adobe Premiere Rush will be specifically demonstrated and supported in the facilitated workshop. Download Microsoft Office (including PowerPoint) <u><a href=\"https:\/\/secure.qut.edu.au\/ithelpdesk\/qut\/softwaredownloads\/downloads.jsp\">here<\/a><\/u> and follow the details attached to download Adobe Premiere Rush: <u><a href=\"https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/Uploads\/EmailAttachments\/KjRlMlmbaHOFPMy-GDnYaw2\/Process-to-Download-Adobe-Premiere-Rush.pdf\">Process-to-Download-Adobe-Premiere-Rush.pdf<\/a><\/u><\/p>",
