***REMOVED***"summary": "Kickstart your career with our engaging workshop designed to help you explore your potential!   You\u2019ll learn how to assess your skills and experiences, setting actionable goals for your academic and professional journey.",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Kickstart your career with our engaging workshop designed to help you explore your potential!&nbsp;<\/p><p>You\u2019ll learn how to assess your skills and experiences, setting actionable goals for your academic and professional journey.&nbsp;<\/p><p>Discover valuable resources available at QUT, including career services and networking opportunities that can enhance your employability.&nbsp;<\/p><p>We\u2019ll discuss the importance of building connections and how to navigate both advertised and hidden job markets.&nbsp;<\/p><p>Join us to gain insights into making informed career decisions and overcoming challenges.<\/p><p>ADVSSG0015k<\/p><p style=\"margin-left: 1120px\"><\/p><p style=\"margin-left: 1120px\"><\/p>",
