***REMOVED***"summary": "Exponentials and logarithms are used to solve many scientific and engineering problems. This workshop will explore exponential and logarithmic functions and the relationship between them.",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Exponentials and logarithms are used to solve many scientific and engineering problems. This workshop will explore exponential and logarithmic functions and the relationship between them.<\/p><p>By the end of this workshop students will be able to<\/p><ul> <li>Use exponential and logarithm rules to solve equations<\/li><\/ul><ul> <li>Identify key features of exponential functions<\/li><\/ul><ul> <li>Understand the relationship between exponentials and logarithms<\/li><\/ul>\n<p>\n\t<span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\"><\/span>\n<\/p>\n<p>\n\t<span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">maths_apw<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\"><span style=\"\"><\/span><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\"><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">ADVSSG0167STEMHLS<\/span><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\"><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\"><\/span><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">ADVSSG0167STEMENG&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">ADVSSG0167STEMITMPS<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\"><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">ADVSSG0167STEMBUS<\/span><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">Study Advantage:&nbsp;<\/span><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\"><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">Power up your skills with exponentials and logarithms<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right\">\n<\/p>",
