***REMOVED***"summary": "Opportunity to gain feedback on your resume, cover letter or LinkedIn profile before clicking send on your next job application.",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Take your job applications to the next level with our <strong>online<\/strong><strong style=\"background-color: initial\">&nbsp;version<\/strong> of the popular <strong style=\"background-color: initial\">Job Application Review Drop-in Service<\/strong>.<\/p><p><strong>Why join?<\/strong>&nbsp;<\/p><p>\u2714 <strong>Personalised feedback<\/strong> to make your resume, cover letter, or LinkedIn profile stand out.<br>\u2714 <strong>Insider tips and advice<\/strong> from Student Success Partners who know what employers look for<\/p><p><strong>What you will need:<\/strong><br>A digital copy of your resume, cover letter, or LinkedIn profile ready to share during your session.<\/p><p><strong>How to register:<\/strong><br>Book your <strong>30-minute appointment<\/strong> today and get expert advice from the comfort of your own space.<\/p><p>We look forward to helping you shine!<\/p><p>ADVSSGCAR<\/p><p>JARSSEM12026<\/p>",
