***REMOVED***"summary": "In this workshop you\u2019ll discover effective learning strategies tailored to your unique strengths, helping you maximise your academic potential. ",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>In this workshop you\u2019ll discover effective learning strategies tailored to your unique strengths, helping you maximise your academic potential.&nbsp;<\/p><p>We\u2019ll explore how to navigate QUT\u2019s systems, including Canvas and HiQ, to streamline your studies and access valuable resources.&nbsp;<\/p><p>Learn practical tips for time management using Covey\u2019s Time Matrix, ensuring you focus on what truly matters.&nbsp;<\/p><p>Additionally, we\u2019ll highlight the support services available, from academic coaching to career guidance, to help you thrive both in and out of the classroom.<\/p><p>ADVSSG0015n<\/p><p style=\"margin-left: 1120px\"><\/p><p style=\"margin-left: 1120px\"><\/p>",
