***REMOVED***"summary": "Drop in to ask questions, get help, collaborate, troubleshoot and converse on coding, data analytics, digital tools, data management or open research in a relaxed atmosphere.",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Put on your headset and Zoom in&nbsp;to connect, collaborate, converse, and get research help in a relaxed atmosphere.<\/p><p>Experts are on hand to advise on coding, data analytics, digital tools or open research. Meet with knowledgeable folk from <a href=\"https:\/\/www.library.qut.edu.au\/about\/whatwedo\/support-researchers\/\">QUT Library<\/a>, the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.qut.edu.au\/institute-for-future-environments\/facilities\/digital-observatory\">Digital Observatory<\/a> and the&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/qutvirtual4.qut.edu.au\/group\/qut\/service-directory?action=view&amp;id=253\">Office of eResearch<\/a>.&nbsp;Show what you\u2019re working on from your device.<\/p><p>Bring your questions on:<\/p><ul>   <li>Data wrangling <\/li>  <li>Programming with R,***REMOVED***  Python, SQL<\/li>  <li>Building and interacting***REMOVED***  with databases<\/li>  <li>Machine learning<\/li><li>Accessing the High Performance Computing service<\/li>  <li>Web APIs and web\/social***REMOVED***  media data collection<\/li>  <li>Version control with Git<\/li><li>Publishing \u2013 where and***REMOVED***  how<\/li>  <li>Open Scholarship and***REMOVED***  Open Research <\/li>  <li>Copyright &amp; Creative***REMOVED***  Commons licensing<\/li>  <li>ORCiD and other***REMOVED***  identifiers<\/li>  <li>Research data publishing<\/li><\/ul><p>Follow us on Twitter&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/twitter.com\/QUTHackyHour\">@QUTHackyHour<\/a> for details or contact <a style=\"background-color: initial\">hackyhour@qut.edu.au<\/a>.<\/p><p style=\"text-align: right\">GRE+D DL LIBOSC007<\/p>",
