***REMOVED***"summary": "Ask questions and get help on managing, planning, sharing, storing, organising, preserving or publishing for your project\u2019s research data.",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Ask questions and get help with managing, planning, sharing, storing, organising, preserving or publishing your project\u2019s research data.<\/p><p>Bring your questions about research data management. <\/p><p>Get help with things like:<\/p><ul><li>Identifying your responsibilities for compliance with QUT procedures and policies<\/li><li>Documenting your research data management needs and information in your Data Management Plan<\/li><li>Storing your research data in safe locations useful for back up, verification, collaboration, analysis and archiving<\/li><li>Organising your research data with file names, directory structures, and .readme files for efficient project management and reuse<\/li><li>Selecting the best repositories for publishing and sharing your data to increase visibility and impact of your research<\/li><\/ul><p>The Research Data Management Consultation is time set aside by the Research Data Librarian where they are available to anyone for questions, discussions, advice, guidance and problem solving.  It is not a class or presentation.<\/p><p style=\"text-align: right\">LIBOSC003<\/p>",
