***REMOVED***"summary": "This workshop will teach you tricks to be successful in the laboratory.",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Attending lab sessions is a crucial part of your education, but it can be challenging for new learners. This workshop aims to ease the transition by providing valuable insights into;<\/p><ul><li><strong>Core lab practices<\/strong>,&nbsp;<\/li><li>Crucial <strong>safety protocols<\/strong>&nbsp;and<\/li><li> Commonly used&nbsp;<strong>equipment and procedures<\/strong> you'll encounter.&nbsp;<\/li><\/ul><p>This foundational knowledge will boost your confidence in the lab, ensuring you are well-prepared as you step into exciting hands-on experiments.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<\/p><p> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p><p>Part of the Semester Ready: Health Program SRH2025.1. <a href=\"https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/students\/events?filterId=722&amp;page=1&amp;studentSiteId=1&amp;text=SRH2025.1\">See the other workshops in this series.<\/a><\/p><p style=\"text-align: right\"><\/p><p style=\"text-align: right\">ADVSSG0167STEMHLS<\/p>",
