***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Connect, Learn &amp; Succeed!<\/p><p>Join us for interactive sessions led by experienced students and staff who are ready to share their knowledge, answer your questions, and help you tackle those tricky topics.<\/p><p>\u2705 Why join?<\/p><ul> <li>Get insider advice on your faculty area<\/li><li>Learn effective study strategies<\/li><li>Connect with peers and build your support network<\/li><li>Stay motivated and on track<\/li><\/ul><p>\ud83d\udc49 Reserve your spot today and take the first step toward success!<\/p>",
