***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Ever wondered what went down in Old Government House?<\/p><p>Join curator Dr Katie McConnel for a free behind-the-scenes tour of <a href=\"https:\/\/www.ogh.qut.edu.au\/\">Old Government House<\/a>.<\/p><p>Explore the fascinating stories of the influential figures who once called this grand building home, from Queensland\u2019s early governors to the pivotal moments that shaped the state\u2019s future. Hear about the lavish parties, significant events, and the major political decisions that were made within its walls. <\/p><p>This immersive experience is perfect for history enthusiasts, heritage lovers, and anyone with a curiosity for the remarkable past of Queensland's most iconic buildings. <\/p><p>Don't miss out on this opportunity to discover Old Government House this February.<\/p><p>Image: Old Government House, Brisbane.&nbsp;<\/p>",
