***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Expert Peer Review of Educational Practice (ExPREP) requires that all applicants attend this workshop before applying for an ExPREP Review. <\/p><p>The workshop introduces:<\/p><ul> <li>the QUT Professional Standards Framework;<\/li><li>the ExPREP process; and<\/li><li>the development of an application.<\/li><\/ul><p>Enroll in the&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/bit.ly\/RTL9_Register\" target=\"_blank\">ExPREP Canvas&nbsp;site<\/a> which has everything you need to take part in an ExPREP review. <\/p><p><img style=\"width: 316px\" src=\"https:\/\/careerhub.qut.edu.au\/Uploads\/Images\/QALT\/21871-QALT-Shape_Blue_Green.jpg\"><\/p>",
