***REMOVED***"details": "<p>If you're a Health Sciences student who finds<strong><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px\"> <u>C<\/u><\/span><\/span><\/strong><u><strong><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px\">hemistry\/Biochemistry calculations<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/u> intimidating, this workshop is for you. It's designed to provide a solid grounding in the quantitative measurements and chemical calculations pertinent to Health Sciences.&nbsp;<\/p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 12px\">Understand the foundational concept of the mole in chemistry.<\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-size: 12px\">Learn how to calculate molarity, a key skill for preparing chemical solutions in lab and clinical settings.<\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-size: 12px\">Grasp how to express medication concentrations in %(w\/v, v\/v, w\/w, ppm, ppb),&nbsp;an essential aspect of pharmaceutical calculations.<\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-size: 12px\">Learn various methods of determining solute concentrations to accurately prepare working solutions from a stock.&nbsp;<\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-size: 12px\">Become adept at converting units, a fundamental skill in science and healthcare that ensures precision in dosages.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<\/span><\/li><\/ul><p style=\"text-align: right\"><\/p><p>Part of the Semester Ready: Health Program SRH2025.1. <a href=\"https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/students\/events?filterId=722&amp;page=1&amp;studentSiteId=1&amp;text=SRH2025.1\">See the other workshops in this series.<\/a><\/p><p style=\"text-align: right\"><\/p><p style=\"text-align: right\">ADVSSG0167STEMHLS<\/p><p style=\"text-align: right\"><\/p><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><p><u><\/u><\/p><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul>",
