***REMOVED***"summary": "Exhibition tour and Floor Talk ",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Join artist Jemima Wyman for a special floor talk for students to introduce her exhibition <em style=\"background-color: initial\">Deep Surface <\/em>at QUT Art Museum.<\/p><p>Celebrating 30 years since she began her studies here at QUT and teeming with dizzying colour and intricate pattern, the exhibition reveals the visual and conceptual complexity that has defined the artist\u2019s diverse output and traces the evolution of her practice from the mid-1990s to today.<\/p><p>Image: Jemima WYMAN&nbsp;<em style=\"background-color: initial\">Domestic rage<\/em>&nbsp;(detail) 2017,&nbsp;sewn custom printed textiles,143 x 199 cm,&nbsp;Collection of Ararat Gallery TAMA.&nbsp;Purchased with the assistance of the Robert Salzer Foundation and Ararat Rural City Council annual allocation, 2017.<\/p>",
