***REMOVED***"summary": "This orientation session is for students commencing in Bachelor of Education (Secondary) Teaching Area 1 - History.",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Welcome to the <strong>Faculty of Creative Industries, Education and Social Justice!<\/strong><\/p><p>This orientation session is for students commencing in&nbsp;<strong>Bachelor of Education (Secondary) Teaching Area 1 -&nbsp;<\/strong><strong>History<\/strong><b style=\"background-color: initial\">.<\/b><\/p><p>Please ensure you register and attend the <a href=\"https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/students\/events\/Detail\/6162020\">Welcome to Bachelor of Education<\/a> and <a href=\"https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/students\/events\/Detail\/6162063\">Welcome to Bachelor of Education and Double Degrees<\/a> session in addition to this event.<\/p><p>In this session you will be introduced to features of the<strong> History teaching area<\/strong> and meet some of the key academic leaders who will support you in your study.<\/p><p>Before you attend your Orientation event, please visit the <strong style=\"background-color: initial\"><a href=\"https:\/\/qutvirtual4.qut.edu.au\/group\/student\/orientation\/your-orientation\/education\">Education Orientation webpage<\/a> <\/strong>and access the welcome video and the other videos that covers <strong style=\"background-color: initial\">Professional Experience, LANTITE, ED59 BEd (Sec) &amp; Dbl Degrees and Blue Cards.<\/strong><\/p><p>If you are studying a double degree, you will also be required to attend the orientation session for the other part of your double degree.<\/p><p>This is an in-person orientation session. Please make sure you register if you plan to attend.<\/p><p>This orientation session is taking place on Tuesday, we recommend having a look at other events happening during <a>Welcome Week<\/a> on that day.<\/p>",
