***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Geckoes Wildlife is&nbsp;bringing the Aussie bush straight to your doorstep!<\/p><p>Whether you\u2019re keen to pat a cute cuddly wombat&nbsp;or snap a pic with a baby crocodile, this event will let you experience our native Australian animals like never before.<\/p><p>Experts will also be there to answer your questions and share fascinating facts about these amazing creatures!&nbsp;Grab your friends and head to YourSpace (C-301)&nbsp;to experience a whole new side of campus life!<\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">\"admincode:social\"<\/span><\/p>",
