***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Want to get acquainted with your campus? A limited number of tours are available with current students to familiarise yourself with the layout of the Gardens Point campus.<\/p><p>Please bring your walking shoes, water bottle, hand sanitiser, and any questions you have about university life.<\/p><p>You must register for this session. Tour guides will monitor numbers as registrations are limited based on ideal group size.&nbsp;<\/p><p>Tours will last for 45 minutes and will depart from the Main Drive near&nbsp;A Block (GP).<\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\"><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\"><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">campustours_welcome26.1<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>",
