***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Interested in studying overseas as part of your QUT degree? Attend our global experiences session to find out about the student exchange program and short-term program opportunities.<\/p><p>This is an <strong>online<\/strong><strong>&nbsp;orientation session<\/strong>. Please make sure you register if you plan to attend.<\/p><p>Please be aware that this session may be recorded. The recording, including any images or sound captured, will be made available via the online orientation platform after the conclusion of the event. The online orientation platform is available to QUT staff and students only.<\/p>",
