***REMOVED***"summary": "Drop in for a warm cup of chai and a chance to meet fellow new students in a relaxed, friendly space. No awkward silences here, we'll help spark the chats so you can kickstart new connections and feel at home in no time. ",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>New to uni and not sure how to start a conversation? We've got you. Drop in for a warm cup of chai and a chance to meet fellow new students in a relaxed, friendly space. No awkward silences here, we'll help spark the chats so you can kickstart new connections and feel at home in no time. Come solo or bring a buddy. Leave with new friends.<\/p><p>Enjoy snacks and chai while you participate.<\/p><p>Continuing students are welcome, too!<\/p><p>QUT You Festival is a series of engaging hands-on experiences that celebrate the <a href=\"https:\/\/qutvirtual4.qut.edu.au\/group\/student\/enrolment\/plan-your-studies\/qut-you\">QUT You<\/a> themes of belonging, connection, and resilience.<\/p><p>Please note, in the spirit of sustainability, we aren't providing drinking water in the venue, so don't forget to fill your waterbottle beforehand!<\/p>",
