***REMOVED***"summary": "A session facilitated by current QUT students designed to assist 1st year students transition into life as a QUT student.",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Learn about being a student at QUT from students who study within your faculty and potentially your degree.<\/p><ul> <li>Connect with your potential classmates<\/li><li>Hear about the student experience at QUT from students themselves<\/li><li>Bring any questions you might have about uni life<\/li><li>Take a guided tour of campus<\/li><\/ul><p>You must register for this session.&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">This Connect session will include a workshop and an optional campus tour, and light refreshments will be provided.<\/span><\/p><p>Please note: You will also need to attend your degree specific welcome session in Welcome Week.&nbsp;<\/p><p><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\"><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"\"><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"\"><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"\"><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"\"><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\"><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\"><\/span><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\"><\/span><\/p><p><span><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">\u201callconnect_26.1\u201d<\/span><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\"><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\"><span style=\"\"><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style