***REMOVED***"summary": "Statistics is indispensable in most careers. Come to this online interactive workshop to prepare for learning statistics as part of your chosen course. ",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p><span style=\"background-color: initial\">By the end of this workshop, you will be able to:&nbsp;<\/span><\/p><ul><li><span style=\"background-color: initial\">Understand what statistics is<\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"background-color: initial\">Understand what is required to learn statistics<\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"background-color: initial\">Learn about \/ revise some fundamental concepts and terminology<\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"background-color: initial\">Find out where to get support for statistics.<\/span><\/li><\/ul><p><span style=\"background-color: initial\"><\/span>ADVSSG0166<br>ADVSSG0167STEMHLS<br>ADVSSG0167STEMENG<br>ADVSSG0167STEMEDU<br>ADVSSG0167STEMITMPS<br>ADVSSG0167STEMBUS<br>ADVSSG0167STEMABE<\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">Study Advantage: Get ready for Statistics<\/span><\/p>",
