***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Welcome to the <strong>Faculty of Health!<\/strong><\/p><p>This orientation session is for students commencing in <strong>Bachelor of Podiatry<\/strong><\/p><p>In this session you will have the opportunity to:<\/p><ul> <li>learn about your degree structure, majors (if applicable) and course requirements;<\/li><li>hear about the possibilities after you finish your degree;<\/li><li>discover study and personal support services available;<\/li><li>to connect with fellow students, and meet academic and professional staff.<\/li><\/ul><p>This is an in-person orientation session. Please make sure you register if you plan to attend.<\/p><p>If you are unable to attend in person, please register for the online version of this information session, details about this event can be found on the <a href=\"https:\/\/qutvirtual4.qut.edu.au\/group\/student\/orientation\/your-orientation\">your orientation<\/a> webpage. It is not necessary to attend both in-person and online sessions as similar content will be covered.<\/p><p>Please be aware that this session may be recorded. The recording, including any images or sound captured, will be made available via the online orientation platform after the conclusion of the event. The online orientation platform is available to QUT staff and students only.<\/p><p>This orientation session is taking place on Wednesday, we recommend having a look at other events happening during <a>Welcome Week<\/a> on that day.<\/p>",
