***REMOVED***"summary": "This live Zoom session that takes a critical look at AI in your assignment research. We\u2019ll focus on how to evaluate AI tools thoughtfully, explore their ethical implications, and discuss strategies for responsible use that supports academic integrity. ",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Worried about GenAI and study? Join your peers and librarians to discuss and learn some hands-on AI skills you can ethically and effectively use for your assignment work. We will use CoPilot and ProQuest Research Assistant to assist you with some common study tasks. You'll also begin to develop critical thinking skills to assess AI outputs by applying an evaluation method to combat misinformation, evaluate the credibility of AI sources, and consider social and environmental impacts. No previous experience with GenAI needed - all welcome.<br>of AI sources, and consider social and environmental impacts. No previous experience with GenAI needed - all welcome.<\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\"><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">libws-genai<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\"><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\"><\/span><\/span><\/p>",
