***REMOVED***"summary": "Well-being Wednesdays are your chance to get quick, friendly, real\u2011talk support from experienced QUT students \u2014 no appointments, no pressure.",
***REMOVED***"details": "<h3><p><strong>\u2b50 Why You Should Join Well-being Wednesday <\/strong><strong>\u2b50<\/strong><\/p><p>It\u2019s a simple way to get the tips, reassurance, and guidance you need to make uni life smoother and less stressful.<\/p><p><strong>Here\u2019s what\u2019s in it for you:<\/strong><\/p><p>\ud83d\udcac Ask anything in a judgement\u2011free space \u2014 study load, stress, navigating uni life, and support options. It\u2019s a safe and friendly place to get clarity.<\/p><p><strong>\ud83d\udca1 Real\u2011life tips from students who\u2019ve been there <\/strong>\u2014 learn what actually helps during exams, busy weeks, and big transitions.<\/p><p>\ud83e\udded Find the right support faster \u2014 we\u2019ll explore resources <em>with you<\/em>, from counselling to workshops, clubs, well-being events and more.<strong><\/strong><\/p><p>\ud83c\udfa8 A calm space to unwind \u2014 grab some pens, colour in, brainstorm ideas, or simply take a breather between classes.<strong><\/strong><\/p><p><strong>\ud83e\udd1d You\u2019re not alone \u2014 <\/strong>if things feel tough, we can point you toward the right support straight away.<\/p><p><strong>Come for advice, a break, or just a friendly chat \u2014 drop in anytime.<\/strong><\/p><p>Your well-being matters, and we\u2019re here to make uni life a little easier<b style=\"font-weight: bold\">\ud83d\udc9b<\/b><\/p><\/h3><p><strong><\/strong><\/p><p><strong><\/strong><\/p><p><strong><\/strong><\/p>",
