***REMOVED***"summary": "A Bubble Tea catchup for commencing students led by our Connect student volunteers.",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Join your fellow first year students and our student volunteer Connectors for our First Year Bubble Tea&nbsp;Catchup. Start your morning off with a Bubble Tea&nbsp;of choice free of charge, and stay to socialise with some of your fellow Gardens Point first-year students. Our Connect volunteers will be on-hand to answer any questions you might have about what it's like to study at QUT.<\/p><p><strong>When: <\/strong>Wednesday 18th February 2026, 10:30am-11:30am<\/p><p><strong>Where: <\/strong>Chatime (Level 2, P Block)<\/p><p><strong>Who: <\/strong>This event is open to all first-year students commencing study at Gardens Point Campus<\/p><p><strong>Details: <\/strong>Bubble Tea is on us! Enjoy your beverage of choice in the company of fellow first-year students and Connect volunteers. <strong>Spaces are strictly limited.<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">\"admincode:social\"<\/span><\/p>",
