***REMOVED***"details": "<p>This Welcome Week preparation workshop will be aimed at providing&nbsp;MZB103\/4\/5&nbsp;students with essential study tips and resources for the semester.<\/p><p>In the session, we will<\/p><ul> <li>Set you up for success in MZB103\/4\/5.<\/li><li>Equip you with resources and places to get help.<\/li><li>Provide you with an opportunity to ask questions about MZB103\/4\/5.<\/li><\/ul><p>This is an online orientation session. Please make sure you register if you plan to attend.<\/p><p>An in-person version of this session is available. If you would prefer attending in-person, please register for the on campus version of this session. Details about this event can be found on the <a href=\"https:\/\/qutvirtual4.qut.edu.au\/group\/student\/orientation\/your-orientation\">your orientation<\/a> webpage. It is not necessary to attend both on campus and online sessions as similar content will be covered.<\/p><p>Please be aware that this session may be recorded. The recording, including any images or sound captured, will be made available to QUT students and staff after the conclusion of the event.<\/p><p>This orientation session is taking place on Wednesday, we recommend having a look at other events happening during <a href=\"https:\/\/qutvirtual4.qut.edu.au\/group\/student\/student-life\/events\/welcome-week\">Welcome Week<\/a> on that day.<\/p>",
