***REMOVED***"summary": "Well-being Wednesdays are your chance to get quick, friendly, real\u2011talk support from experienced QUT students \u2014 no appointments, no pressure.",
***REMOVED***"details": "<h3>\u2b50 Why You Should Join Well-being Wednesday&nbsp;\u2b50<\/h3><p>It\u2019s a simple way to get the tips, reassurance, and guidance you need to make uni life smoother and less stressful.<\/p><p>Here\u2019s what\u2019s in it for you:<\/p><p>\ud83d\udcac <strong>Ask anything in a judgement\u2011free space<\/strong> \u2014 study load, stress, navigating uni life, and support options. It\u2019s a safe and friendly place to get clarity.<\/p><p>\ud83d\udca1 <strong>Real\u2011life tips from students who\u2019ve been there<\/strong> \u2014 learn what actually helps during exams, busy weeks, and big transitions.<\/p><p>\ud83e\udded <strong>Find the right support faster<\/strong> \u2014 we\u2019ll explore resources <em>with you<\/em>, from counselling to workshops, clubs, well-being events and more.<\/p><p>\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>A calm space to unwind<\/strong> \u2014 grab some pens, colour in, brainstorm ideas, or simply take a breather between classes.<\/p><p>\ud83e\udd1d <strong>You\u2019re not alone<\/strong> \u2014 if things feel tough, we can point you toward the right support straight away.<\/p><p>Come for advice, a break, or just a friendly chat \u2014 <strong>drop in anytime<\/strong>.<\/p><p><br>Your well-being matters, and we\u2019re here to make uni life a little easier \ud83d\udc9b<\/p><p><strong><\/strong><\/p><p><strong><\/strong><\/p><p><strong><\/strong><\/p>",
