***REMOVED***"details": "<p>\n\tThis session will introduce the basic features&nbsp;of H5P. We will discuss layout tools, activity tools and live engagement tools, as well as strategies for using these tools effectively.&nbsp;To make the most of session feel free to bring along ideas for specific activities that you want to design. As part of this workshop you will gain access to a Canvas site of examples and tips for using H5P,&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/canvas.qut.edu.au\/enroll\/PBD6BA\" target=\"_blank\">enrol here<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p>\n\tAlong with the demonstration, there will be an opportunity for Q&amp;A at the end of the session.&nbsp;<br>\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 6px\"><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">REF: RTL10<\/span><\/span>\n<\/p>",
