***REMOVED***"summary": "Boost your employability by making the most of your university experience.***REMOVED*** This Welcome Week workshop helps you connect your studies with your career goals, build valuable relationships, and discover ways to seek further careers support. ",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>In this session, you\u2019ll explore how academic study contributes to your long-term career development. You\u2019ll learn where to access ongoing career support and how to build the skills, connections, and confidence that enhance your employability.<\/p><p>By the end of this workshop, you will:<\/p><ul> <li>Understand how your studies link to career planning and professional growth.<\/li><\/ul><ul> <li>Recognise the importance of networking and industry awareness.<\/li><\/ul><ul> <li>Identify opportunities to engage with social, professional, and community networks that strengthen your employability.<\/li><\/ul><p>ADVSSGCAR<br>ADVSSG0167GEN<\/p>",
