***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Join us for an insightful workshop on Academic Integrity and the Role of Artificial Intelligence! This session will explore the importance of maintaining academic honesty and how to avoid common pitfalls like plagiarism and collusion. You\u2019ll gain practical strategies for using AI responsibly in your assessments, ensuring you understand what is acceptable and what isn\u2019t. Through engaging discussions and practical scenarios, you\u2019ll learn how to navigate academic expectations with confidence. Don\u2019t miss this opportunity to find out more about how to work ethically and more effectively!&nbsp;<\/p><p> ADVSSG0015h<br>ADVSSG0167GEN<\/p>",
