***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Welcome to the <strong>Faculty of Business and Law!<\/strong><\/p><p>This orientation session is for students commencing in <strong>Postgraduate Business<\/strong> courses (all majors).<\/p><p>In this session you will have the opportunity to:<\/p><ul> <li>learn about your degree structure and course***REMOVED***  requirements;<\/li>  <li>hear about the possibilities after you finish your***REMOVED***  degree;<\/li>  <li>discover study and personal support services***REMOVED***  available;<\/li>  <li>connect with fellow students and interact with***REMOVED***  specially designed activities.<\/li><\/ul><p>This is an online orientation session. Please make sure you register if you plan to attend.<\/p><p>Please be aware that this session may be recorded. The recording, including any images or sound captured, will be made available to QUT students and staff after the conclusion of the event.<\/p><p>This orientation session is taking place on Wednesday, we recommend having a look at other events happening during <a href=\"https:\/\/qutvirtual4.qut.edu.au\/group\/student\/student-life\/events\/welcome-week\">Welcome Week<\/a> on that day. If you are new to QUT, you may like to register for a <strong>QUT Connect<\/strong> session&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/students\/events?filterId=2095\">Online<\/a> as well.<\/p>",
