***REMOVED***"summary": "A coffee catchup for commencing students led by our Connect student volunteers.",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Join your fellow first year students and our student volunteer Connectors for our First Year Coffee Catchup. Start your morning off with a coffee or hot beverage of choice free of charge, and stay to socialise with some of your fellow Gardens Point first-year students. Our Connect volunteers will be on-hand to answer any questions you might have about what it's like to study at QUT.<\/p><p><strong>When: <\/strong>Thursday 19th February 2026, 9:00am-10:00am<\/p><p><strong>Where: <\/strong>The Kitchen Cafe, The Courtyard (inside Old Government House)<\/p><p><strong>Who: <\/strong>This event is open to all first-year students commencing study at Gardens Point Campus<\/p><p><strong>Details: <\/strong>Coffee\/tea\/hot chocolate is on us! Enjoy your morning beverage of choice in the company of fellow first-year students and Connect volunteers. <strong>Spaces are strictly limited.<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">\"admincode:social\"<\/span><\/p>",
