***REMOVED***"summary": "An overview of research data storage changes - 19 Feb",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Join us for an online session to walk through the Research Data Storage changes in the Data Management Planner (DMP) and gain an understanding of what these changes mean for you.<\/p><p>Background:<\/p><p>We have improved research data management at QUT by updating the DMP to include the provisioning of data storage and the ability for users to manage access. Users log into the Data Management Planner and create a data management plan. The DMP automatically creates a Research Plan ID (RPID), and the user can request research data storage via the DMP if needed. When requested, a folder will be automatically provisioned and associated with the RPID.<\/p><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(31, 73, 125, 1)\">Who are these sessions for:<\/span><\/strong><\/p><p>The sessions are for researchers and staff storing research data at QUT.<\/p><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(31, 73, 125, 1)\">Session details:<\/span><\/strong><\/p><p>Three sessions are being&nbsp;offered in Feb 2026 to provide people with options. Each session will contain the same information. Please book into&nbsp;one session.<\/p><p>&nbsp;Register via the button above<\/p><table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody><tr><td><span style=\"color: rgba(31, 73, 125, 1)\"><strong>Session<\/strong><\/span><\/td><td><span style=\"color: rgba(31, 73, 125, 1)\"><strong>Date<\/strong><\/span><\/td><td><span style=\"color: rgba(31, 73, 125, 1)\"><strong>Time<\/strong><\/span><\/td><td><span style=\"color: rgba(31, 73, 125, 1)\"><strong>How to register<\/strong><\/span><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Support session 1: research data storage changes<\/td><td>Tues 17 February<\/td><td>10:00-10:45am<\/td><td><a href=\"https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/students\/events\/detail\/6826103\">Register here<\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Support session 2: research data storage changes<\/td><td>Thur 19 February<\/td><td>10:00-10:45am<\/td><td>Register via the button above<a href=\"https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/students\/events\/detail\/6749500\"><\/a><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Support session 3: research data storage changes<\/td><td>Wed 25 February<\/td><td>2:00-2:45pm<\/td><td><a href=\" https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/students\/events\/detail\/6826112\">Register here<\/a><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(31, 73, 125, 1)\">Can't make the session but need support:<\/span><\/strong><\/p><p>Visit the Research Data Storage section of the&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/docs.eres.qut.edu.au\">eResearch Info Hub<\/a> for details of the change, including videos and FAQs or reach out to eResearch via&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:mailto:eresearch@qut.edu.au\">eresearch@qut.edu.au<\/a>.<\/p>",
