***REMOVED***"details": "<p>We\u2019re excited to welcome you to QUT!  Join us at the Global Lounge for a relaxed and friendly event spaced especially for new international students. This is a great opportunity to meet other students, connect with support staff, and start building your QUT community.<\/p><ul><li>Meet other international students from around the world<\/li><li>Learn about QUT support services<\/li><li>Guided help with settling into life in Brisbane including accommodation support<\/li><\/ul><p>Date: <strong>Tuesday 17th \u2013 Friday 20th February 2026<br><\/strong>Time: 10am \u2013 2pm.&nbsp;Book in a time that suits you.<\/p><p>Location: Global Lounge, YourSpace, D Block, Gardens Point Campus<\/p><p>Please register for one of the sessions so that we can host you well.<\/p>",
