***REMOVED***"summary": "Develop strategies to help support quality HDR thesis writing. Please enter from here: https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/students\/Events\/Online\/6847291",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Develop strategies to help support quality HDR thesis writing. This workshop provides an opportunity to engage with other HDR Supervisors, practise identifying thesis writing issues and discuss strategies to encourage and support writing development.<\/p><p><strong>What you'll learn:<\/strong><\/p><ul> <li>Gain skills to identify and address issues with thesis writing<\/li><li>Learn strategies to encourage and support the development of effective HDR thesis writing skills<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Key benefits:<\/strong><\/p><ul> <li>Wanting to better support your HDRs in their writing skill development, but not quite sure where to start?<\/li><li>This workshop shows you how to guide HDRs to take control of their own writing development<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>What previous participants have said:<\/strong><\/p><p><em><strong><\/strong>The whole session was great - comments in the 'Chat' were good - information on slides (links, references, etc.) were all good for me.<\/em><\/p><p>Offering: GRE+D SUP RSCS025<\/p>",
