***REMOVED***"summary": "Guided Meditation ",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Join QUT Galleries and Museums Engagement Coordinator Renae Belton for meditation and slow looking on a tour of <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wrgallery.qut.edu.au\/whats-on\/exhibitions-folder\/william-robinson-reflections\"><em>Reflections <\/em><\/a>at the William Robinson Gallery this Welcome Week.<\/p><p><em>Reflections<\/em> explores the transformative moment when William Robinson discovered the artistic possibilities of multiple perspectives. From shimmering creek beds to mist-laden rainforests, the exhibition reveals Robinson\u2019s masterful use of water as both subject and metaphor\u2014honouring a visionary who helped shape the language of Australian landscape painting.<\/p><p>All welcome. Registrations essential.&nbsp;<\/p><p>Image:&nbsp;William ROBINSON, <em style=\"background-color: initial\">The blue pools, Springbrook to Beechmont<\/em>&nbsp;(detail) 2000, oil on linen. QUT Art Collection. Purchased through the William Robinson Art Collection Fund, 2013.<\/p>",
