***REMOVED***"summary": "Join us for a tour of the Creative Industries Precinct at Kelvin Grove Campus",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Want to get acquainted with your campus? A limited number of tours are available with current students to familiarise yourself with the layout of the Kelvin Grove campus - Creative Industries precinct.<\/p><p>Please bring your walking shoes, water bottle, hand sanitiser, and any questions you have about university life.<\/p><p>You must register for this session. Tour guides will monitor numbers as registrations are limited based on ideal group size.&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">Before you book, please note that all on campus QUT Connect sessions will include an optional campus tour.<\/span><\/p><p>Tours will last for 45 minutes and will depart from the&nbsp;Z2 level one entrance on Musk Avenue. Look out for the person in the QUT Connect shirt!<\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\"><span style=\"\"><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\"><span style=\"\"><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\"><span style=\"\"><\/span><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">campustours_welcome26.1<\/span><\/span><\/p>",
