***REMOVED***"summary": "Plan to succeed in your career, right from the start of your Higher Degree Research degree. Please enter from here: https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/students\/Events\/Online\/6871532",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Plan to succeed in your career, right from the start of your Higher Degree Research degree. In this workshop, gain insights into identifying opportunities that employers rate most highly. Start planning early to make the most of all your opportunities to create a stable, successful career after study.<\/p><p><strong>What you'll learn:<\/strong><\/p><ul> <li>Find out about strategies that make the most of a competitive job market<\/li><li>Understand what you need to do during your candidature to be successful in your career<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Key benefits:<\/strong><\/p><ul> <li>Kickstart your HDR career adventures so you can keep sight of your end goal of life-long employability, while still meeting your HDR milestones<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>What previous participants have said:<\/strong><\/p><p><em>Karen is very kind and knowledgeable, and gave us a lot of helpful pointers for how to proceed with our career development. This session provided me with a lot of guidance for simple, achievable, and incredibly useful things I can do going forward.<\/em><\/p><p>Offering: GRE+D CD RSCH164<\/p>",
