***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Welcome to the <strong>Faculty of Health!<\/strong><\/p><p>This orientation session is for students commencing in <strong>Bachelor of Biomedical Sciences<\/strong>&nbsp;and associated double degrees.<\/p><p>In this session you will have the opportunity to:<\/p><ul> <li>learn about your degree structure, majors (if applicable) and course requirements;<\/li><li>hear about the possibilities after you finish your degree;<\/li><li>discover study and personal support services available;<\/li><li>to connect with fellow students, and meet academic and professional staff.<\/li><\/ul><p>If you are studying a double degree, you will also be required to attend the orientation session for the other part of your double degree.<\/p><p>This is an in-person orientation session. Please make sure you register if you plan to attend.<\/p><p>This orientation session is taking place on Thursday, we recommend having a look at other events happening during <a>Welcome Week<\/a> on that day.<\/p>",
