***REMOVED***"summary": "Business Cases and why they\u2019re important, hosted by Digital Business Solutions : https:\/\/qut.zoom.us\/j\/81736413898?pwd=cdvoVUXWU74V3fx5IJPnxtSd2GTwPL.1",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p><em>Round 2 - Unlocking your Digital Potential - Digital &amp; AI Fluency<\/em>, hosted by Digital Business Solutions.<\/p><p>As a continuation of our successful C3 Program, this series of Connect and Share Sessions is available for staff within the Administrative Division.<\/p><p>The Connect and Share sessions are a virtual short and sharp 45-minute session. These will be an opportunity for us to share, learn and connect together on a range of topics. The sessions will be hosted by a different Department or Portfolio area each month so that we can showcase the innovative and valuable work that happens across the Division.<\/p><p><u>C3 Connect and Share Session Schedule<\/u><\/p><table><tbody><tr><td>Topic<\/td><td>Host Area<\/td><td>Date \/ Time<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Head &amp; Heart Leader Scale (from Kirstin Ferguson\u2019s Head &amp; Heart,<br>the Art of Modern Leadership)<\/td><td>Human Resources<\/td><td>Tuesday, 29 April<br>12:45 pm<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Psychological Hazards<\/td><td>Health, Safety and Environment<\/td><td>Tuesday, 24 June<br>10:30 am<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Cyclone Preparedness and Storm Monitoring:<br>Facilities Management &amp; Campus Services Role in Response and Management<\/td><td>Facilities Management &amp;<br>Campus Services<\/td><td>Thursday, 31 July<br>1:00 pm<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>College of Excellence<\/td><td>Student Engagement<\/td><td>Wednesday, 27 August<br>11:00 am<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>University Masterplan \u2013 Real World Made Real<\/td><td>Campus Services<\/td><td>Tuesday, 11 November<br>10:00 am<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Disability and Accessibility Team<\/td><td>Student Services<\/td><td>Wednesday, 3 December<br>1:30 pm<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Significant Governance Milestones in 2025<\/td><td>QUT Governance<\/td><td>Thursday, 29 January<br>10:30 am<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Round 2 - Unlocking your Digital Potential - Digital &amp; AI Fluency. <\/td><td>Digital Business Solutions<\/td><td>Thursday, 19 February<br>1:30 pm<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Student Critical Incident Management<\/td><td>Student Services<\/td><td>Wednesday, 25 March<br>10:30 am<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><p><a href=\"https:\/\/mediahub.qut.edu.au\/playlist\/dedicated\/121237\/0_fs5e26bk\/0_a02ekou7\">View previous C3 Connect and Share Session recordings on MediaHub.<\/a><\/p>",
