***REMOVED***"summary": "In this thrilling event, you\u2019ll join forces to create the most terrifying two-sentence horror stories imaginable.",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Be careful, it\u2019s dangerous to go alone! In this thrilling event, you\u2019ll join forces to create the most terrifying two-sentence horror stories imaginable. The stakes are high and the rewards are spine tingling \u2014 pizza, prizes, friendship, and breath-taking stories. You could win one of two $50 gift vouchers for the best story!<\/p><p>Reader beware, you\u2019re in for a scare!<\/p><p>QUT You Festival is a series of engaging hands-on experiences that celebrate the <a href=\"https:\/\/qutvirtual4.qut.edu.au\/group\/student\/enrolment\/plan-your-studies\/qut-you\">QUT You<\/a> themes of belonging, connection, and resilience. <\/p><p>Note: This event explores horror themes and may be unsettling for some participants.<\/p>",
