***REMOVED***"details": "<p><strong>Postgraduate Networking Afternoon<\/strong><\/p><p>Calling all commencing postgraduate students! Join us for an afternoon of connection, collaboration, and community at our <strong>Postgraduate Networking Event<\/strong>. This is the perfect opportunity to meet fellow postgrad students from different disciplines, exchange ideas, and expand your academic and professional network.<\/p><p>Enjoy <strong style=\"background-color: initial\">free food and refreshments<\/strong> while engaging in meaningful conversations with peers who share your academic journey. Whether you're looking for research collaborators, career insights, or just new friends, this event is designed to help you build valuable connections in a relaxed and welcoming setting.<\/p><p>Come for the networking, stay for the food\u2014don\u2019t miss out!<\/p>",
