***REMOVED***"summary": "Have your questions answered as you begin your research degree. Please enter from here: https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/students\/Events\/Online\/6862272",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Have your questions answered as you begin your research degree. This online question and answer session is facilitated by staff members from Graduate Research who will respond to your candidature and researcher training queries. This session is a companion to the HDR Orientation event. If you were unable to attend that session (but have watched the recording), this after-hours session gives you an opportunity to have your questions answered.<\/p><p><strong><em>What you'll learn:<\/em><\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Learn how to make the most of your HDR candidature by taking an active role<\/li><li>Find out what other HDR students are saying and asking<\/li><\/ul><p><strong><em>Key Benefits:<\/em><\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Not everyone can make it to the Orientation session. Even if you have watched the recording, you may not have had the chance to directly ask your questions. This is your chance!<\/li><\/ul><p><strong><em>What previous participants have said:<\/em><\/strong><\/p><p><em>The Presenters answered my question seamlessly, thank you. Now I get many insight.<\/em><\/p><p>Offering: GRE+D RP RSCH219<\/p>",
