***REMOVED***"summary": "This workshop teaches students how to evaluate and select relevant educational resources to avoid information overload.",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udc47Reasons why you should not miss this workshop! \ud83d\udc47<\/p><p>In this digital era, the issue is not a lack but an overabundance of information thanks to the internet and smartphones. You may find thousands of resources for a single question, but without wielding information literacy, you could be drowning in unnecessary information. <u>Resource overload<\/u> could lead to cognitive overload, a serious problem for students' academic performance and mental health. Attending this workshop will help you analyse and choose relevant instructional materials.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<\/p><p style=\"text-align: right\">ADVSSG0015f<br>ADVSSG0167STEMHLS<br>ADVSSG0167STEMITMPS<br>ADVSSG0167STEMENG<br>ADVSSG0167STEMEDU<br>ADVSSG0167STEMABE<\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">Study Advantage: Wield STEM resources effectively and avoid cognitive overload<\/span><\/p>",
