***REMOVED***"summary": "Maths not your strong suit? Overcome your fear of mathematics, and learn how to master this subject area so you can solve problems inside and outside the classroom! ",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Maths not your strong suit?<span style=\"background-color: initial\"> Overcome your fears of mathematics and learn how to master this subject area. You will learn how maths can be about connections, curiosity and creativity. Learn actionable strategies to boost your maths capabilities at university and a get guidance on where to get help when you are stuck in the learning pit! This workshop is ideal if you are studying Education, or any field where maths skills are assumed knowledge. In this workshop you will: Explore your mindset around maths, and the role that plays in your learning.  Apply research-based principles and metacognitive strategies for effective maths learning and problem-solving, including: estimation, visualisation, verbalisation, learning multiple methods, developing understanding, making mistakes. Locate the resources and support to develop your mathematical skills.&nbsp;<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: initial\">ADVSSG0085<br><\/span>ADVSSG0167ABE<br>ADVSSG0167BUS<br>ADVSSG0167ENG<br>ADVSSG0167EDU<br>ADVSSG0167ITMPS<\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">Study Advantage: Set yourself up for success with maths<\/span><\/p>",
