***REMOVED***"summary": "Want to improve your time management skills and organise your week? In this session you will learn to plan effectively, set priorities that matter, and build the resilience to follow through. ",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Time passes quickly when you are juggling work, life, and uni. Sometimes your assignments are due in the same week, your work calls you in for extra shifts or your family needs you. Learning to manage your time is crucial to success. This workshop will cover:<\/p><ul> <li>Skills to plan your time and organise your week<\/li><\/ul><ul> <li>Strategies to prioritise your tasks to help you get started with assessments<\/li><\/ul><ul> <li>Extra opportunities for support to help you persevere through your studies<\/li><\/ul><p>ADVSSG0068<br>ADVSSG0167GEN<\/p>",
