***REMOVED***"summary": "Friday\u2019s Friends is a relaxed, welcoming drop in space designed to help you meet people, explore fun things happening at QUT, and feel more at home \u2014 whether you stay five minutes or the whole hour.",
***REMOVED***"details": "<h3><p><strong>\ud83c\udf1f Friday\u2019s Friends \u2014 Your End\u2011of\u2011Week Drop\u2011In Spot<\/strong><\/p><p><strong>Looking to feel more connected at uni? \ud83d\udcac\ud83d\udc99<\/strong><\/p><p>Friday\u2019s Friends is a relaxed, welcoming drop\u2011in space designed to help you meet people, explore fun things happening at QUT, and feel more at home \u2014 whether you stay five minutes or the whole hour.<br> <br> <\/p><p><strong>\u2728 Why join us??<\/strong><\/p><ul>   <li><strong>\ud83e\udd1d***REMOVED***  Meet new people (without the awkwardness!)&nbsp;<\/strong>Swing by a comfy, friendly space***REMOVED***  with a signed desk, chairs, and room to chat. Drop in any time \u2014 no***REMOVED***  booking, no pressure.<strong><\/strong><\/li>  <li><strong>\ud83c\udf89***REMOVED***  Discover clubs, events &amp; communities you'll actually enjoy&nbsp;<\/strong>From social sports to Guild events,***REMOVED***  Discord groups, and QUT clubs \u2014 we\u2019ll help you find activities that match***REMOVED***  you and your interests.<strong><\/strong><\/li>  <li><strong>\ud83d\udd0d***REMOVED***  Personalised suggestions for getting involved&nbsp;<\/strong>Not sure where to start? Let\u2019s***REMOVED***  search together. You\u2019ll get ideas based on what <em>you<\/em> enjoy \u2014 whether***REMOVED***  that\u2019s hobbies, study support, volunteering, or fun social groups.<strong><\/strong><\/li>  <li><strong>\ud83d\udcac***REMOVED***  A safe space to ask questions (big or small)&nbsp;<\/strong>Whether you're curious about clubs,***REMOVED***  support options, or campus life, you\u2019ll have someone friendly to chat to \u2014***REMOVED***  someone who \u201cgets\u201d uni and can point you in the right direction.<strong><\/strong><\/li>  <li><strong>\ud83d\ude0c***REMOVED***  A relaxed vibe&nbsp;<\/strong>Perfect if you\u2019re new, shy,***REMOVED***  curious, or just passing by between classes. No expectations \u2014 just good***REMOVED***  conversations, helpful people, and genuine connection.<strong><\/strong><\/li><\/ul><\/h3><p><strong><\/strong><\/p><p><strong><\/strong><\/p><p><strong><\/strong><\/p>",
