***REMOVED***"summary": "Exhibition tour and Floor Talk ",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Join curator Katherine Dionysius in conversation with artist Jemima Wyman as they delve into <em style=\"background-color: initial\">Deep Surface<\/em>\u2014the exhibition and monograph\u2014and Wyman\u2019s survey show capturing 30 years of creative practice. This discussion explores Wyman\u2019s politically charged investigations into camouflage, collective organizing, democracy, and dissent, tracing the evolution of her practice from the mid-1990s to today.<\/p>",
