***REMOVED***"summary": "Make this your week of getting organised as you plan out and run your research project. Please join from here: https:\/\/canvas.qut.edu.au\/courses\/1233\/pages\/focus-week, (only works once you have self-enrolled in the module)",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Another way to complete the module is to enrol in Focus Week. With like-minded researchers and an expert staff member, you\u2019ll work through the module content as a group, exploring any project management issues in discussion forums. You\u2019re welcome to attend if you haven\u2019t yet completed the module, but will get the most out of Focus Week if you\u2019re already familiar with the content. The experience is week-long, but your commitment may be less than 30 minutes per day, at a time that suits you.<\/p><p><strong>What you'll learn:<\/strong><\/p><ul> <li>Gain a deeper understanding of the strategies discussed in the Manage your research project module<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Key benefits:<\/strong><\/p><ul> <li>Share your experiences and seek advice in focused discussion forums during the week<\/li><\/ul><p><em><strong>What previous participants have said:<\/strong><\/em><em><strong><\/strong><\/em><\/p><p><em>Highly recommend it, it's a quick way to understand and implement and certainly very useful!<\/em><strong><\/strong><\/p><p>Offering: GRE+D PM RSCH210<\/p>",
