***REMOVED***"summary": "Students in this workshop will get a solid foundation in Medical Terminology without having to memorize thousands of words or rely on a dictionary.",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p><strong>Are you overwhelmed by the idea of memorising a plethora&nbsp;of medical terms?<\/strong><strong>&nbsp;<\/strong>If so, take advantage of this carefully planned session to teach you a surprisingly simple way to learn medical vocabulary&nbsp;\u2013 your ultimate guide to mastering the language of medicine.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p><p>Some testimonials from students about this workshop: \"<strong>Clear helpful content<\/strong>\", \"<strong>great<\/strong>\", \"<strong>excellent course<\/strong>\", \"<strong>very useful<\/strong>\", <strong>thoroughly enjoyable<\/strong>\", \"<strong>engaging<\/strong>\", \"<strong>It was very important<\/strong>\", \"<strong>organised<\/strong>\".&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p><p>Part of the Semester Ready: Health Program SRH2025.1. <a href=\"https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/students\/events?filterId=722&amp;page=1&amp;studentSiteId=1&amp;text=SRH2025.1\">See the other workshops in this series.<\/a><\/p><p style=\"text-align: right\"><\/p><p style=\"text-align: right\">ADVSSG0167STEMHLS<\/p><p style=\"text-align: right\"><\/p><p style=\"text-align: right\"><\/p><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><ul><p><u><\/u><\/p><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul><\/ul>",
