***REMOVED***"details": "<p>This online workshop will give you some practical tips and guidance for your  semester studying Education units. In the workshop we will provide support  with:<\/p><ul><li>different types of assessment in Education<\/li><li>key features of academic paragraphs<\/li><li>using academic evidence to support your ideas<\/li><li>writing clearly and coherently<\/li><\/ul><p>We will offer the resources to everyone who has registered after the session. To ensure you receive the resources:<\/p><ol><li>Book into the event<\/li><li>Check and respond to&nbsp;your QUT student email after the event has ended<\/li><\/ol><p><a href=\"https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/students\/events\/search?text=law+drop+in&amp;EventType=31&amp;campus=\"><\/a><\/p><p style=\"text-align: right\">ADVSSG0146<\/p>",
