***REMOVED***"details": "<p><strong>Kickstart your postgraduate journey in Health with confidence!<\/strong><\/p><p>This friendly and practical session is designed for students in Graduate Certificates, Diplomas, and Masters by Coursework programs. We\u2019ll explore what to expect in your studies, how academic life at university works, and how to balance your time when there\u2019s a lot to juggle.<\/p><p>Learn simple strategies to plan time for reading, manage your workload, and stay on track in the first few weeks. You\u2019ll also be introduced to key support services, including library help, study planning tools, and research resources to make your start a smooth one.<\/p><p>Part of the <em style=\"background-color: initial\"><a href=\"https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/students\/events?page=1&amp;studentSiteId=1&amp;text=SRH2025.1\">Semester Ready Health Program<\/a><\/em>. See the full list <a href=\"https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/students\/events?page=1&amp;studentSiteId=1&amp;text=SRH2025.1\">here<\/a>.&nbsp;<\/p><p><span style=\"font-size: 10px\">SRH2025.1.&nbsp;<\/span><\/p><p style=\"text-align: right\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px\">ADVSSG0071<\/span><\/p>",
