***REMOVED***"summary": "In today\u2019s competitive job market, a strong personal brand is essential. LinkedIn is a powerful tool for showcasing your skills and experience to potential employers. This workshop will guide you in creating a compelling LinkedIn profile and show you how to leverage it to expand your professional network, discover job opportunities, and access the hidden job market.",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p><strong>What will you learn in this workshop?<\/strong><\/p><ul> <li>Create and optimize your LinkedIn profile<\/li><li>Use LinkedIn to explore career options and uncover hidden job opportunities<\/li><li>Build and expand your professional network<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Who should attend?<\/strong><\/p><p>This workshop is ideal for students and recent graduates who:<\/p><ul>   <li>Want to create or enhance their LinkedIn profile<\/li>  <li>Are actively seeking job opportunities<\/li><\/ul><p>New to LinkedIn? Please <a href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/signup\/cold-join?trk=guest_homepage-basic_nav-header-join\">sign up here<\/a> prior to the workshop. <\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">ADVSSGCAR<\/span><\/p>",
