***REMOVED***"summary": "New to Excel or need a refresher? This workshop introduces the fundamentals of Excel so you can use it in your studies, no matter what you are studying.",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>\n\tThis workshop is recommended for students who are new to Excel or looking to boost their confidence working with Excel. We will introduces important concepts such as the structure of spreadsheets, importing data, basic sorting and filtering, and more. The aim is to make you comfortable working in the Excel environment, rather than becoming a data manipulation expert.<\/p><p>\n\tBy the end of this workshop, students will be able to:<\/p><ul>\n\t\n<li>Explain important Excel concepts, including spreadsheets, rows, columns, cells, and formulas<\/li>\t\n<li>Update and import data<\/li>\t\n<li>Manage worksheets<\/li>\t\n<li>Undertake simple calculations in Excel<\/li>\t\n<li>Filter and sort data<\/li>\t\n<li>Create simple visualisations.<\/li><\/ul><p>\n\tPlease <strong>bring your own laptop<\/strong> to work on, or <a href=\"https:\/\/qutvirtual4.qut.edu.au\/group\/student\/it-and-printing\/computer-labs-and-loans\">borrow one<\/a> as a short term loan from HiQ.<\/p><p>Want to learn more about Excel? Check out the next workshop in the series:&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/students\/events?page=1&amp;studentSiteId=1&amp;text=Data%20exploration%20with%20excel\">Data Exploration with Excel<\/a>.<\/p><p>Part of the STEM Academic Preparedness Workshop Program<\/p><p><\/p><p style=\"text-align: right\"><span style=\"color: rgba(216, 216, 216, 1)\">ADVSSG0167STEMABE<span style=\"color: rgba(216, 216, 216, 1)\"><br>ADVSSG0167STEMBUS<br>ADVSSG0167STEMCI<br>ADVSSG0167STEMEDU<br>ADVSSG0167STEMENG<br>ADVSSG0167STEMHLS<br>ADVSSG0167STEMITMPS<\/span><\/span><\/p><p><\/p>",
