***REMOVED***"summary": "Got questions about uni life, assessments, or how things actually work at QUT? Swing by Topical Tuesday at the Learning Hubs\u2014no bookings, just friendly faces and straight answers.",
***REMOVED***"details": "<h3>\u2b50 Why You Should Join Topical Tuesday \u2b50<\/h3><p><strong>Because uni is easier when you don\u2019t have to figure it all out alone.<\/strong><\/p><p>Here\u2019s what makes Topical Tuesday worth dropping into:<\/p><p><strong>Some questions don\u2019t quite fit in class or at HiQ<\/strong> \u2014 that\u2019s exactly what this space is for. Ask the \u201csmall\u201d, \u201csilly\u201d, or \u201cI should probably know this already\u201d questions without worry.<\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">You can finally de\u2011mystify how uni works -&nbsp;<\/span><\/span>Timelines, processes, hidden steps, expectations \u2014 we help break it all down so everything feels clearer and easier to navigate.<\/p><h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">You\u2019ll get personalised support (without needing to be an expert) -&nbsp;<\/span><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">We don\u2019t expect you to know everything \u2014 and you don\u2019t need to! We use a \u201clet\u2019s find out together\u201d approach and help you connect to the right services, tools, and people.<\/span><\/h3><h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">You\u2019ll meet other students and build real connections -&nbsp;<\/span><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">Topical Tuesday creates an easy, welcoming environment to chat, share experiences, and connect with peers.<\/span><\/h3><h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">It\u2019s relaxed, friendly and genuinely welcoming -&nbsp;<\/span><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">The space is set up for drop\u2011ins, open conversation, and making you feel comfortable the moment you arrive.<\/span><\/h3><p><strong>What topics are we discussing - <\/strong>well, that's up to you.&nbsp; See you soon!<\/p><p><strong><\/strong><\/p><p><strong><\/strong><\/p>",
