***REMOVED***"summary": "Learn ways to approach studying in your Health course and get tips on planning your semester.",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>This workshop explores valuable planning skills, including:<\/p><ul> <li>Finding and using unit outlines<\/li><li>Managing time<\/li><li>Making a plan<\/li><li>Getting started with assessments<\/li><li>Accessing further support during the semester<\/li><\/ul><p>Part of the <em><a href=\"https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/students\/events?page=1&amp;studentSiteId=1&amp;text=SRH2025.1\">Semester Ready: Health program<\/a><\/em>. See the full list <a href=\"https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/students\/events?page=1&amp;studentSiteId=1&amp;text=SRH2025.1\">here<\/a>.&nbsp;<\/p><p>SRH2025.1<\/p><p style=\"text-align: right\">ADVSSG0067<\/p>",
