***REMOVED***"name": "Student Success: Enhance your academic success by connecting with STEM support",
***REMOVED***"eventType": "Study, research and learning",
***REMOVED***"eventTypeId": 31,
***REMOVED***"prerequisiteFormId": null,
***REMOVED***"start": "2026-02-24T15:00:00+10:00",
***REMOVED***"end": "2026-02-24T15:45:00+10:00",
***REMOVED***"publish": "2025-12-19T14:20:00+10:00",
***REMOVED***"expire": "2026-02-24T15:45:00+10:00",
***REMOVED***"isActive": true,
***REMOVED***"isCancelled": false,
***REMOVED***"summary": "The aim of this workshop is to explain what STEM support is available, how to access this support and why it will help you to achieve your goals. We will also help demonstrate useful strategies to improve your academic success. If you wish, bring a friend.",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>There are thousands of&nbsp;people at QUT who are keen for you to be successful. Everyone is different though and this workshop will help to explain how you can access support for your learning. We aim to develop learning strategies, build knowledge,&nbsp;skills and confidence, and foster valuable connections to enhance your learning at QUT.<\/p><p>This workshop session focuses on STEM support - for students studying STEM or needing maths, science, or IT as part of their studies&nbsp;but other academic support is available and will be explained too. One key to academic success is to seek assistance, whether you are just trying to pass, aiming to get great marks, or your focus is to optimise your&nbsp;learning. There are many useful strategies and support structures. This session provides an introduction to what is available.<\/p><p>For STEM support, we have a team of specialist staff and trained students across all the faculties who provide support. Students can access learning resources, STEM academic preparedness workshops,&nbsp;exam prep&nbsp;workshops, study sessions, drop-in support and consultations on request. We do not offer tutoring but are here to help you to learn.<\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">Study Advantage: Enhance your academic success by connecting with STEM support<\/span><\/p>",
