***REMOVED***"summary": "This workshop will support you in your reflective writing as part of your application",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>\n\t<strong style=\"background-color: initial\">We highly recommend you complete the <u><a href=\"http:\/\/bit.ly\/RTL5_Register\" target=\"_blank\">self-directed online module<\/a><\/u> PRIOR to attending the facilitated workshop. The self-directed online module will:<\/strong>\n<\/p>\n<ul>\n\t<li><strong>introduce the new 2023 Professional Standards Framework<\/strong><\/li>\n\t<li><strong>explain the difference between the Fellowship categories<\/strong><\/li>\n\t<li><strong>discuss common challenges faced by applicants<\/strong><\/li>\n\t<li><strong>outline the application and review process<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>\n\tThis facilitated workshop will:\n<\/p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>support you in your reflective writing as part of your application<\/li>\n\t<li>give you time and support to practice and plan your application<\/li>\n\t<li>give you the opportunity to ask general questions of the QALT team and seek specific guidance on elements of your application<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>\n\tWe encourage you to enrol in the \n\t<a style=\"text-decoration-line: underline\" href=\"http:\/\/bit.ly\/RTL5_Register\" target=\"_blank\">self-directed online module<\/a> and&nbsp;visit sections 3.2 and 4.2 to&nbsp;download the following documents to your device prior to the workshop:\n<\/p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Application template<\/li><li>Applicant guide<\/li>\n\t<li>HEA Fellowship Writing Planner<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>\n\tTo be eligible to apply for fellowship, you must have completed the \n\t<u><a href=\"http:\/\/bit.ly\/FL5_Register\" target=\"_blank\">Indigenous Perspectives and Knowledges&nbsp;in Learning and Teaching module<\/a><\/u>.\n<\/p>",
