***REMOVED***"summary": "Find answers to your HDR milestone questions from our panel of experts. Please enter from here: https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/students\/Events\/Online\/6871381",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Find answers to your HDR milestone questions from our panel of experts. This is an online information session about your HDR milestone processes, documents and presentations. Come to this session prepared with any questions or fears you have about your upcoming milestones, and hear from our QUT experts. Not only will you have your queries answered but you'll find out information that you didn't even realise you needed to know!<\/p><p><strong>What you'll learn:<\/strong><\/p><ul> <li>Find out about the processes involved in completing HDR milestones<\/li><li>Gain insight into the format of milestone forms and research documents<\/li><li>Learn about presenting at your milestone events<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Key benefits:<\/strong><\/p><ul> <li>Get your milestone questions answered<\/li><li>Transform your milestones into positive experiences<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>What previous participants have said:<\/strong><\/p><p><em>Loved having it as a conversational session where everyone shared their expertise<\/em><\/p><p><\/p><p>Offering: GRE+D RP RSCH034<\/p>",
