***REMOVED***"summary": "Start the semester strongly with this workshop to help you to understand the expectations of academic writing for your CI & Comms Assessments",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>This online workshop will give you some practical tips and guidance for your  semester studying CI &amp; Communication&nbsp;units. In the workshop we will provide support  with:<\/p><ul><li>different types of academic writing, including essays, critiques and reflections<\/li><li>key features of academic paragraphs<\/li><li>using academic evidence to support your ideas.<\/li><\/ul><p>We will record the workshop and send the resources to everyone who has attended after the session. To ensure you receive the resources:<\/p><ol><li>Book into the event<\/li><li>Use the Zoom link to attend <\/li><li>Check your QUT student email after the event has ended<\/li><\/ol><p><a href=\"https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/students\/events\/search?text=law+drop+in&amp;EventType=31&amp;campus=\"><\/a><\/p><p style=\"text-align: right\">ADVSSG0147<\/p>",
