***REMOVED***"summary": "Clauses are the building blocks of English sentences. Come along to this workshop to learn about different types of clauses and how to combine them to create different types of sentences and make your writing clearer, more impactful, and more interesting.",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Grammar Matters is a program of interactive sessions, designed to help improve the clarity of your ideas in academic assessments. There is a weekly&nbsp;online session from Week 1 to Week 8, with each one focusing on a different grammar skill&nbsp;that students often find difficult:<\/p><ol> <li>Sentence Structure<\/li><li>Connecting Ideas Together<\/li><li>Verb tenses<\/li><li>Active and Passive Voice<\/li><li>Academic Tone and Formality<\/li><li>Paraphrasing<\/li><li>Punctuation<\/li><li>Articles and Other Determiners<\/li><\/ol><p>These sessions will:<\/p><ul> <li>show you how to use grammar to clarify meaning in your written assessments, <\/li><li>improve your confidence in applying your knowledge of grammar when preparing academic assessments. <\/li><\/ul><p>The sessions include:<\/p><ul> <li>a review of the relevant structure and how it can be used in an academic context<\/li><li>practice activities<\/li><li>opportunities to ask specific questions about grammar you find difficult.<\/li><\/ul><p>Link to register for the Grammar Matters sessions:&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/qutvirtual4.qut.edu.au\/group\/student\/study\/academic-help-and-workshops\/writing-and-speaking-skills\" target=\"_blank\">https:\/\/qutvirtual4.qut.edu.au\/group\/student\/study\/academic-help-and-workshops\/writing-and-speaking-skills&nbsp;<\/a><\/p><p style=\"text-align: right\"><\/p><p style=\"text-align: right\"><\/p><p style=\"text-align: right\"><\/p><p style=\"text-align: right\"><\/p><p style=\"text-align: right\">ADVSSG0073f<\/p>",
