***REMOVED***"summary": "Learn key principles for writing quality research journal articles. Please enter from here: https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/students\/Events\/Online\/6862277",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Learn the key principles for writing quality research journal articles. This workshop will help demystify the article writing process and guide you in establishing effective writing habits to achieve your publishing goals. Join us for an opportunity to improve your understanding of journal article writing skills.<\/p><p><strong>What you'll learn:<\/strong><\/p><ul> <li>Learn the key principles and elements of a research article that journal reviewers are looking for.<\/li><li>Learn effective writing habits to help increase your writing output.&nbsp;<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Key benefits:<\/strong><\/p><ul> <li>If you\u2019re planning to publish your research, but you\u2019re not sure where to start, this workshop is for you.&nbsp;<\/li><li>Remember, your paper won\u2019t write itself!<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>What previous participants have said:<\/strong><\/p><p><em>Keri was very engaging, helpful and responsive! We were able to have a nice group dialogue via the chat and receive insight, advice and feedback from Keri. The advice given throughout the session was relevant and broken down to be easy to implement.<\/em><\/p><p>Offering: GRE+D AC RSCH252<\/p><p><strong><\/strong><u><\/u><\/p>",
