***REMOVED***"summary": "Drop In, Save Smart, Stress Less! A relaxed space to chat, learn, and pick up real life tips for thriving at uni on a budget",
***REMOVED***"details": "<h3><p>\ud83c\udf1f Thrifty Thursdays: Drop In, Save Smart, Stress Less!<\/p><p>A relaxed space to chat, learn, and pick up real life tips for thriving at uni on a budget.<\/p><p>\ud83d\udca1 Why come along?<\/p><p>\u2022Get practical, student tested tips for saving money, budgeting, and making your dollars stretch further.<\/p><p>(e.g., affordable meal ideas, discounts, smart spending strategies) <\/p><p>\u2022Discover support you didn\u2019t know existed \u2014 bursaries, emergency funds, scholarships, the QUT Guild Foodbank, and more. <\/p><p>\u2022Ask any question, big or small, about uni life, money, careers or navigating QUT services \u2014 no judgement, no pressure. <\/p><p>\u2022Connect with friendly, experienced students who\u2019ve been in your shoes and can point you in the right direction. <\/p><p>\u2022Walk away with useful links, hacks and tools you can use right away to make study life easier. <\/p><p>\ud83d\udecb What\u2019s the vibe?<\/p><p>\u2022Drop in anytime \u2014 no bookings needed. <\/p><p>\u2022A welcoming desk setup with space to chat, ask questions or explore resources together. <\/p><p>\u2022Casual, friendly conversations with someone who gets it.<\/p><p>\ud83c\udf92 What you\u2019ll get out of it<\/p><p>\u2022Budget friendly tricks for food, study essentials and day to day uni life. <\/p><p>\u2022Pointers to opportunities like flexible student jobs through UniHub. <\/p><p>\u2022Ideas for cheap, quick meals and campus specials worth knowing about<\/p><p>\u2022Guidance on support pathways if things aren\u2019t going well \u2014 from well-being to academic help. <\/p><p>\ud83d\udc4b Who\u2019s it for?<\/p><p>Any student wanting to\u2026<\/p><p>\u2022Save money<\/p><p>\u2022Make smart choices<\/p><p>\u2022Learn about supports<\/p><p>\u2022Feel more confident navigating life at QUT<\/p><p>\u2022Or simply have a friendly chat<\/p><\/h3><p><strong><\/strong><\/p><p><strong><\/strong><\/p><p><strong><\/strong><\/p>",
