***REMOVED***"summary": "This workshop will guide you through the most critical details of calculus, to develop an understanding of important concepts such as limits, basics of differentiation, integration and differential equations. It is particularly useful if you are studying CVB203, MZB125 or MZB105.",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>\n\tThis workshop will guide you through the most critical details of calculus, to develop an understanding of important concepts such as limits, basics of differentiation, integration and differential equations. It is particularly useful if you are studying CVB203, MZB125 or&nbsp;MZB105.<\/p>\n<p>\n\tBy the end of this workshop, students will be able to:\n<\/p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Understand the different conceptions of derivatives and integrals <\/li>\n\t<li>Apply the fundamental rules of differentiation and integration <\/li>\n\t<li>Identify the gaps in their calculus knowledge to build a study plan <\/li>\n\t<li>Locate the resources and support needed to expand their understanding of calculus<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>\n\t<span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\"><\/span>\n<\/p>\n<p>\n\t<span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">maths_apw<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">ADVSSG0167STEMENG&nbsp;<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">ADVSSG0167STEMITMPS<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">ADVSSG0167STEMEDU<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">ADVSSG0167STEMBUS<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">Study Advantage: Prepare yourself for success using calculus<\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right\">\n<\/p>",
