***REMOVED***"summary": "Connect with the real world during candidature and explore industry opportunities. Please enter from here: https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/students\/Events\/Online\/6874220",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Connect with the real world during candidature and explore industry opportunities. The session will cover HDR internships, design sprints, mentoring programs, placements and more. Plus, we will explore how engaging with industry can increase your research impact and set you up for success in your future career in Academia or industry. You'll leave with a better understanding of QUT's HDR Industry engagement program and how these opportunities can help develop and complement your HDR experience.<\/p><p><strong>What you'll learn:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Gain an understanding of what the HDR Industry Engagement program is, how it works, and how it can benefit you<\/li><li>Understand and reflect on the benefits of industry engagement and internships to complement your HDR experience<\/li><li>Build an understanding of how these opportunities can help you explore and progress your career goals<\/li><li>Explore potential options and how you can secure an opportunity<\/li><li>Increase your awareness of the support, training and opportunity available to help you achieve industry engagement success<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Key benefits:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Gain and understanding of the importance of connecting with the real-world during candidature<\/li><li>Improve your ability to source industry engagement opportunities<\/li><li>Develop and evidence your research skills in the real world for future career success, whether in academia or industry<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>What previous participants have said:<\/strong><\/p><p><em>All the advice and links provided. Feels nice knowing QUT provides so many resources.<\/em><\/p><p>Offering: GRE+D IE RSCH237<\/p>",
