***REMOVED***"details": "<p><strong>Come join your fellow HDR students and meet your QUT Librarians for morning tea<\/strong>.<\/p><p>This key social&nbsp;event in the semester calendar&nbsp;provides a wonderful opportunity to meet fellow HDRs face-to-face in a relaxed setting.<\/p><ul><li>Mix with your fellow&nbsp;peers about projects or ideas<\/li><li>Talk to Faculty Librarians about services, resources, and support<\/li><li>Enjoy provided beverages and bites<\/li><li>Be in the running for door prizes and pick up some great giveaways<\/li><\/ul><p>Held in the GP Gibson Room, enjoying great views.&nbsp;<\/p><p>See a quick&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/mediahub.qut.edu.au\/media\/t\/0_joijexfu\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(238, 236, 225, 1)\">promo clip here<\/span><\/a>.<\/p>",
