***REMOVED***"summary": "A workshop to help you avoid procrastinating and make a strong start on your assignments.",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>During this workshop, we'll introduce an approach that will help you understand exactly what you need to do for an assignment and make a strong&nbsp;start. The strategies and tools presented in this workshop will help you:<\/p><ul><li>break an assignment down into a series of achievable tasks;<\/li><li>plan your time to ensure you meet the deadline;<\/li><li>ensure you understand exactly what is required;<\/li><li>reduce the overwhelm often experienced when working on an assignment.&nbsp;<\/li><\/ul><p>We will record the workshop and send the resources to everyone who has registered after the session. To ensure you receive the resources:<\/p><ol><li>Book into the event<\/li><li>Use the Zoom link to attend <\/li><li>Check your QUT student email after the event has ended<\/li><\/ol><p><a href=\"https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/students\/events\/search?text=law+drop+in&amp;EventType=31&amp;campus=\"><\/a><\/p><p style=\"text-align: right\">ADVSSG0146<\/p>",
