***REMOVED***"summary": "Are you looking for part-time or casual work? Come and build your r\u00e9sum\u00e9 and learn how to find these roles.",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>All work experience can help you build your professional career.  Come to this workshop and learn about the value of part-time casual work. In this workshop you will learn: Where to find part-time \/ casual jobs, How to tailor your application to the role, Your rights at work. This is an active workshop where you will create or update your r\u00e9sum\u00e9 for part-time\/casual work and leave ready to apply for roles! To prepare for this workshop, please have ready a copy of your r\u00e9sum\u00e9 if you have one. This session will provide an excellent opportunity for you and other students to engage and ask questions, lead group discussion, and guide the learning outcomes.&nbsp;<\/p><p>ADVSSGCAR<br>ADVSSG0167GEN<\/p>",
