***REMOVED***"summary": "Write a research proposal demonstrating critical thinking and the value of your research. Please enter from here: https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/students\/Events\/Online\/6862306",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Write a research proposal demonstrating critical thinking and the value of your research. In this Writing Workshop, we will be practising techniques to improve the quality of your research proposal.<\/p><p><strong>What you'll learn:<\/strong><\/p><ul> <li>Understand the key elements of a research proposal<\/li><li>Learn strategies to inform and persuade the reader of the value of your research<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Key benefits:<\/strong><\/p><ul> <li>Your research proposal is a sales pitch. Find out how best to sell your research.<\/li><li>Join other HDRs in a supportive learning environment<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>What previous participants have said:<\/strong><\/p><p><em>I really liked the step through and examples of how best to structure each section of the proposal. It gave me some great places to start to ensure my proposal is well structured and covers all the important aspects e.g. aims, gaps, significance<\/em><\/p><p>Offering: GRE+D AC RSCH264<\/p>",
