***REMOVED***"summary": "Opportunity to gain feedback on your resume, cover letter or LinkedIn profile before clicking send on your next job application.",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p><strong>Stand Out to Employers!<\/strong><br>Join our <strong>Job Application Review Drop-In Sessions<\/strong> and get expert feedback on your <strong>resume, cover letter, or LinkedIn profile<\/strong> from our trained Student Success Partners.<\/p><p><strong>Why attend?<\/strong><br>\u2714 Receive personalised feedback to strengthen your application documents<br>\u2714 Gain insider tips and advice from experienced Student Success Partners<\/p><p><strong>What to bring:<\/strong><br>A printed or digital copy of your resume, cover letter, or LinkedIn profile.<\/p><p><strong>How it works:<\/strong><\/p><ul> <li>Drop in anytime during the 3-hour session<\/li><li>Each student will have up to 30 minutes with a Student Success Partner<\/li><li>Last review starts 30 minutes before the session ends<\/li><li>Assistance is first-come, first-served (short waits may occur)<\/li><\/ul><p>We look forward to helping you shine!<\/p><p>ADVSSGCAR<\/p><p>JARSSEM12026<\/p>",
