***REMOVED***"summary": "Do you have questions about how to start building your professional profile in the Australian IT workplace or about what resources QUT has available to support you? If so, join us online and let's chat.",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Are you a post-graduate IT student and do you have questions about how to navigate your job search? Whether you\u2019re curious about job search strategies, employment opportunities, or getting job-ready, our drop-in sessions are here to help. Bring your job search related questions to the session anytime during the drop-in. International students, you're especially encouraged to attend.<\/p><p>This week's drop-in is one of a 5-week series. Each week will have a key topic, but students are invited to ask any&nbsp;job search related&nbsp;question. The drop-in sessions will be hosted by the Faculty of Science Career Educators.<\/p><p>Key Topics<\/p><p>Week 1: Tips on building your&nbsp;professional identity&nbsp;<\/p><p>Week 2: Tips on job seeking<\/p><p>Week 3: Tips on&nbsp;resumes<\/p><p>Week 4: Tips on digital profiles eg. Linked-In<\/p><p>Week 5: Tips on prepping for a job interview<\/p><p>ADVSSGCAR<\/p><p>#2026MITDropin<\/p>",
