***REMOVED***"summary": "Would you like to connect ideas together more effectively when you write? Join this session if you would like to improve the flow of your writing and make it clearer by using strategies that help your reader make clear connections between your ideas.",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Grammar Matters is a program of interactive sessions, designed to help improve the clarity of your ideas in academic assessments. There is a weekly online session from Week 1 to Week 8, with each one focusing on a different grammar skill that students often find difficult:<\/p><ol> <li>Sentence Structure<\/li><li>Connecting Ideas Together<\/li><li>Verb tenses<\/li><li>Active and Passive Voice<\/li><li>Academic Tone and Formality<\/li><li>Paraphrasing<\/li><li>Punctuation<\/li><li>Articles and Other Determiners<\/li><\/ol><p>These sessions will:<\/p><ul> <li>show you how to use grammar to clarify meaning in your written assessments,<\/li><li>improve your confidence in applying your knowledge of grammar when preparing academic assessments.<\/li><\/ul><p>The sessions include:<\/p><ul> <li>a review of the relevant structure and how it can be used in an academic context<\/li><li>practice activities<\/li><li>opportunities to ask specific questions about grammar you find difficult.<\/li><\/ul><p>Link to register for the Grammar Matters sessions: <a href=\"https:\/\/qutvirtual4.qut.edu.au\/group\/student\/study\/academic-help-and-workshops\/writing-and-speaking-skills\">https:\/\/qutvirtual4.qut.edu.au\/group\/student\/study\/academic-help-and-workshops\/writing-and-speaking-skills&nbsp;<\/a><\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/qutvirtual4.qut.edu.au\/group\/student\/study\/academic-help-and-workshops\/writing-and-speaking-skills\" target=\"_blank\"><\/a><\/p><p style=\"text-align: right\"><\/p><p style=\"text-align: right\"><\/p><p style=\"text-align: right\"><\/p><p style=\"text-align: right\"><\/p><p style=\"text-align: right\"><\/p><p style=\"text-align: right\">ADVSSG0073g<\/p>",
