***REMOVED***"summary": "Learn how the 12 key skills essential to successful researchers will benefit you. Please enter from here: https:\/\/unihub.qut.edu.au\/students\/Events\/Online\/6871536",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p>Learn how the 12 key skills essential to successful researchers will benefit you. This workshop provides an overview of the key skills, shows you how each skill will be useful for your research and career, and steps you through a process of identifying which skills to prioritise and when to focus on building those skills.<\/p><p><strong>What you'll learn:<\/strong><\/p><ul> <li>Understand the essential skills needed by HDRs<\/li><li>Recognise the transferability of your research skills to other aspects of your life and career<\/li><li>Develop the ability to prioritise your skills development training<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>Key benefits:<\/strong><\/p><ul> <li>As an HDR student, there is much to learn, and it is largely up to you to coordinate your own training.<\/li><li>This session helps you plan your skills development in a way that matches your individual needs.<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>What previous participants have said:<\/strong><\/p><p><em>The plan of attack across the candidature journey was very helpful<\/em><strong><\/strong><\/p><p>Offering: GRE+D CD RSCH170<\/p><p><a href=\"http:\/\/qut.to\/oj9b2\"><\/a><\/p>",
