***REMOVED***"summary": "Build your communication confidence and get ready for nursing placement with weekly sessions that each focus on a different communication skill. Practise handovers, ISBAR, speaking, listening, responding to feedback and goal setting to feel more confident on placement. ",
***REMOVED***"details": "<p><strong style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); background-color: initial\">This workshop will help<\/strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); background-color: initial\">&nbsp;<strong>Nursing students practise speaking and listening skills that will be used on&nbsp;placemen<\/strong><strong>t<\/strong>.&nbsp;It's suitable for any Nursing students in NS42 or NS89, domestic or international,&nbsp;from any year of their course and for students with English as an additional or first language. The workshops focus on practising common communication scenarios that might happen on a Nursing placement, for example,&nbsp;giving and receiving instructions, practising handovers, using ISBAR,&nbsp;listening carefully to patients and&nbsp;colleagues, communicating your goals for placement,&nbsp;recording information and setting communication targets.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); background-color: initial\"><\/span><\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/mediahub.qut.edu.au\/media\/t\/0_59up52ov\"><strong>Watch a video about the session.<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p>You might also like to access some&nbsp;helpful <strong>self-directed activities<\/strong> in our Padlet,&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/qut.padlet.org\/successhealth\/build-your-language-skills-for-health-jqmgpod6z3ijgho3\"><strong>Build Your Language Skills for Health<\/strong><\/a>. It's full of ideas for developing long-term strategies around speaking, listening, reading, writing, grammar and connecting with others.&nbsp;<\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\"><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">The online sessions utilise Zoom. If you would like training in using Zoom, please click&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/qutvirtual4.qut.edu.au\/group\/student\/it-and-printing\/software-and-learning-tools\/zoom\">here<\/a>.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\"><br><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\"><\/span><\/p><p style=\"text-align: right\">ADVSSG0054<\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)\">Communication Skills for Placement<\/span><\/p><p><strong><\/strong><\/p><strong><\/strong>",
